<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">Rough: Sekoumady. Rework: Nov 02. Checked with team: Dec 02.</book>
  <para style="h">Waxayi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ala xa Waxayi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Waxayi</para>
  <para style="mt">Ala xa Waxayi</para>
  <para style="imt">Masenyi nde yi Kitaabui xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="ip">Annabi Yaya naxa yi Kitaabui sɛbɛ waxati xɔrɔxɔɛ bun ma. Mangasanyi ɲaaxi nu na Isayankae ɲaxankatafe tɛmui naxɛ, Ala naxa e yaabi yi masenyi ra naxan nɔma findide madundui xungbe ra danxaniyatɔɛe bɛ naxee na tɔɔrɔfe Sentanɛ saabui ra.</para>
  <para style="ip">Isa yi Kitaabui fɔlɔma bataaxɛ solofere nan na danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama ndee bɛ. A a masenma a a e xa wali birin kolon, naxan fanxi, a nun naxan mu fanxi. Na findixi sɛriyɛ nan na adamadie bɛ. Ala fe birin kolon. A lanma won xa a kolon a won ma fe yo mu nɔxunxi Ala ma. A mu nɛɛmuma won ma wali yo ma. Na masenyi mɔɔli nan nɔma won madundude xa won na tɔɔrɔfe Ala xa fe ra, kɔnɔ a man nɔma won magaaxude xa won na fe ɲaaxi nde kui.</para>
  <para style="ip">A firin nde, yi Kitaabui a masenma nɛ won bɛ a Ala fe kolon naxan fama rabade duniɲa ma. Ala Sentanɛ xa wali kolon, a mixi madaxuma ki naxɛ. Sentanɛ ɲɔxɔ a ma a a nɔma nɔde Ala sɛnbɛ ra. Wule nan na ki. Yi Kitaabui xa masenyi xungbe findima Ala xa xunnakeli nan na. Sentanɛ fama nɛ Ala nun danxaniyatɔɛe gerede, a fa mixi sɛniyɛnxie tɔɔrɔde a gbegbe ra. Kɔnɔ a raɲɔnyi, Ala fama nɛ Sentanɛ nun a fɔxirabirɛe birin xa fe xun nakanade, a e woli yahannama tɛ nun soda xɔɔra, e luma dɛnnaxɛ abadan. A fa a xa ɲama tongo, a e raso ariyanna kui, dɛnnaxan xili falama «Darisalamu Nɛɛnɛ.» Mɛnni, adamadi kisi kolonma nɛ naxan maniyɛ mu na. Faxɛ mu na, tɔɔrɛ mu na. Hɛɛri nan tun na mɛnni Alatala sɛɛti ma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yi Kitaabui xaranfe ndedi xɔrɔxɔ, barima sɛbɛli na a ra naxan taali wɔyɛnyi rawalima a gbegbe ra. Misaali gbegbe na a kui naxee a niyama a fahaamu xa xɔnɔ. A mu lanma mixi xa kankan misaali nde ma naxan xɔrɔxɔ. Won xa na birin xaran, alako won xa masenyi xungbe to naxan minima yi Kitaabui kui. Na mu xɔrɔxɔ alɔ misaali xunxuri nde naxee rawalima yi Kitaabui kui.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ala xa lɔnni fi won ma yi xaranyi kui. Amina.</para>
  <para style="imte">Ala xa Waxayi</para>
  <para style="cl">Sora</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1" />
  <para style="s">Isa xa masenyi fɔlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1" />Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi Isa xa laamatunyi nan ya, Ala naxan fixi a ma. A xa malekɛ naxa na rasanba a xa konyi Yaya ma, alako Ala xa konyi di birin xa a kolon fe naxan fama rabade yi waxati. <verse eid="REV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2" />Yaya findixi seede nan na Ala xa masenyi xa fe ra a nun Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi Isa xa seedeɲɔxɔya xa fe ra. A naxan to, a naxa na birin masen. <verse eid="REV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3" />Hɛɛri na a xaran mixi bɛ, a nun naxee e tuli matima yi masenyi ra naxan tixi Ala xili ra, e man fa yi sɛbɛli ratinmɛ, barima waxati bara makɔrɛ.<verse eid="REV 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4" />N tan Yaya, n bara yi sɛbɛli ti Isa xa danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama dɔxɔ solofere ma, naxee na Asi bɔxi ma. Ala xa hinnɛ nun bɔɲɛsa fi wo ma, Ala naxan na xoro, to, a nun tina. Xaxili solofere naxee na a xa mangɛ kibanyi ya i, nee fan bara hinnɛ wo ra, <verse eid="REV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5" />a nun Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi Isa, naxan findixi seede tinxinxi ra, naxan singe keli mixi faxaxie tagi, naxan dangi bɔxi mangɛ birin na. Matɔxɔɛ na Isa nan bɛ, naxan won xanuxi, naxan won nakisixi won ma yunubie ma a wuli saabui ra. <verse eid="REV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6" />A bara won naso Ala xa mangɛya niini bun ma, a bara won findi sɛrɛxɛdubɛe ra a Baba Ala bɛ. Nɔrɛ nun sɛnbɛ na a bɛ abadan! Amina.<verse eid="REV 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7" />Wo wo ya rate koore ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 1:7">a na fafe nuxuie kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 1:7">Adamadi birin a toma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 1:7">hali naxee a masɔxɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 1:7">Duniɲa si birin fama sunnunde a xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 1:7">Iyo, a na na ki nɛ. Amina!<verse eid="REV 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8" />Marigi Ala xa masenyi nan ya: «N tan nan na a fɔlɛ ra, n tan nan na a raɲɔnyi ra, n tan naxan na xoro, to, nun tina, Sɛnbɛ Birin Kanyi.»<verse eid="REV 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9" />N tan Yaya, wo ngaxakerenyi, won birin na tɔɔrɔfe, won birin na Ala xa mangɛya niini nan bun ma, won birin tunnabɛxixi Isa xa fe i. N nu na Patimosi suri nan ma Ala xa masenyi nun Isa xa seedeɲɔxɔya xa fe ra. <verse eid="REV 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10" />Ala xa lɔxɔɛ, Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi to n suxu, n naxa xui nde mɛ n xanbi ra. A sɛnbɛ gbo alɔ sara xui. <verse eid="REV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11" />A naxa a masen n bɛ, «I naxan toxi, a sɛbɛ Kitaabui kui, i xa a rasanba danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama dɔxɔ solofere ma, naxee na Efɛsɛ, Simirina, Peregamo, Tiyatire, Saradesi, Filadelifiya, nun Layodiseya.»<verse eid="REV 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12" />N naxa n mafindi alako n xa a to naxan wɔyɛnxi n na. N to n mafindi, n naxa lanpui xɛɛma daaxi solofere to. <verse eid="REV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13" />N naxa adamadi maniyɛ to na lanpuie tagi, donma kuye ragoroxi a ma, bɛlɛti xɛɛma daaxi balanxi a kanke ra. <verse eid="REV 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14" />A xunyi nun a xunsɛxɛ nu fiixɛ alɔ yɛxɛɛ xabe fiixɛ, xa na mu a ra balabalanyi. A yae nu yanbama alɔ tɛ. <verse eid="REV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15" />A sanyie nu gbeelixi alɔ wure gbeeli raxunuxi, a xui nu gbo alɔ baa mɔrɔnyi xui. <verse eid="REV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16" />Tunbui solofere nu na a yirefanyi bɛlɛxɛ, santidɛgɛma dɛ firin daaxi xɛɲɛnxi nu na a dɛ i, a yatagi mayanbama alɔ soge xɔnɛ.<verse eid="REV 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17" />N to a to n naxa bira a bun ma, n fa lu alɔ mixi faxaxi. A naxa a yirefanyi bɛlɛxɛ sa n ma, a fa a fala, «Hali i mu gaaxu. N tan nan na a fɔlɛ nun a raɲɔnyi ra. <verse eid="REV 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18" />N ɲiɲɛ na a ra. N nu bara faxa, kɔnɔ yakɔsi n ɲiɲɛ na a ra abadan. Faxɛ nun aligiyama saabi kanyi na n tan nan na. <verse eid="REV 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19" />I xa fe nan sɛbɛ i naxan toxi, naxan na rabafe, a nun naxan fama rabade. <verse eid="REV 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20" />Yi tunbui solofere i naxee toxi n yirefanyi bɛlɛxɛ kui, e misaalixi Isa xa danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama dɔxɔ solofere xa malekɛe nan na. Yi lanpui xɛɛma daaxi solofere, e misaalixi Isa xa danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama dɔxɔ solofere nan na.»<verse eid="REV 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2" />
  <para style="s">Bataaxɛ danxaniyatɔɛ ɲamae bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1" />A sɛbɛ Efɛsɛ danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama xa malekɛ ma, masenyi nan ya naxan fatanxi Isa ra tunbui solofere suxuxi naxan yirefanyi bɛlɛxɛ kui, naxan ɲɛrɛma lanpui xɛɛma daaxi solofere tagi: <verse eid="REV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2" />«N wo xa fe rabaxi kolon, n wo xa wali kolon, n wo xa tunnabɛxi kolon. N a kolon mixi ɲaaxie mu rafan wo ma. N a kolon wo bara mixie makiiti naxee e yɛtɛ findixi Ala xa xɛɛrae ra, han wo fan fa e kolon wule falɛe ra. <verse eid="REV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3" />Wo bara wo tunnabɛxi, wo bara tɔɔrɔ n xili xa fe ra, kɔnɔ limaniya mu baxi wo yi ra.»<verse eid="REV 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4" />«Kɔnɔ fe keren na na naxan mu rafanxi n ma wo xa fe ra. Wo mu n xanuxi a fanyi ra yakɔsi alɔ wo nu n xanuxi ki naxɛ singe ra. <verse eid="REV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5" />Wo xa wo ratu a ma, wo nu na ki naxɛ beenun wo xa wo san nadin. Wo xa tuubi, wo man xa wali suxu alɔ wo nu a rabama singe ra ki naxɛ. Xa wo mu tuubi n fama nɛ wo xɔnyi, n fa wo xa lanpui bade a yire.»<verse eid="REV 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6" />«Kɔnɔ wo bara fe nde raba naxan fan. Wo bara Nikolasi xa ɲama xa fe xɔn, alɔ n fan a xɔnxi ki naxɛ.»<verse eid="REV 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7" />«Tuli na naxan bɛ, a xa a tuli mati Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi xa masenyi ra danxaniyatɔɛ ɲamae bɛ. Naxan na geeni, n na nan luma a xa simaya wuri bogi don, naxan tixi Ala xa ariyanna kui.»<verse eid="REV 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8" />A sɛbɛ Simirina danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama xa malekɛ ma, masenyi nan ya naxan fatanxi Isa ra, Isa naxan na a fɔlɛ nun a raɲɔnyi ra, naxan nu faxaxi a man fa keli faxɛ ma: <verse eid="REV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9" />«N wo xa ɲaxankatɛ nun setareɲa kolon, hali bannaya nde to na wo yi ra. N Yuwifie xa tɔɔɲɛgɛ kolon wo mabiri. E a falama e yɛtɛ bɛ a Yuwifie, a fa li Yuwifie mu e ra. E findixi Sentanɛ xa mixie nan na. <verse eid="REV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10" />Wo naxa gaaxu ɲaxankatɛ ya ra, wo fama naxan sɔtɔde. Ibulisa a niyama nɛ wo xa mixi ndee xa sa geeli, alako a xa wo mato. Wo fama nɛ ɲaxankatade xi fu bun ma. Kɔnɔ wo xa lu danxaniya kui han wo faxɛ lɔxɔɛ. Na tɛmui n kisi fima nɛ wo ma wo sare ra.»<verse eid="REV 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11" />«Tuli na naxan bɛ, a xa a tuli mati Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi xa masenyi ra danxaniyatɔɛ ɲamae bɛ. Naxan na geeni, a mu faxɛ firin nde kolonma.»<verse eid="REV 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12" />A sɛbɛ Peregamo danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama xa malekɛ ma, masenyi nan ya naxan fatanxi Isa ra, santidɛgɛma dɛ firin xɛɲɛnxi kanyi: <verse eid="REV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13" />«N a kolon wo xa taa findixi Sentanɛ sɛnbɛ yire nan na, kɔnɔ wo xirixi n xili ra, wo mu danxaniya raboloxi. Hali waxati ma, n dugutɛgɛ seede Antipasi faxa tɛmui naxɛ wo xɔnyi Sentanɛ yire, wo mu n ma kira rabɛɲin.»<verse eid="REV 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14" />«Kɔnɔ fe ndee na na naxee mu rafanxi n ma wo xa fe ra. Wo xa mixi ndee birama Balami xa misaali nan fɔxɔ ra, naxan nu bara Balaki rasi a xa gantanyi te Isirayilakae bɛ, e xa subee don naxee baxi sɛrɛxɛ ra kuyee bɛ, e xa yɛnɛ fan naba. <verse eid="REV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15" />Wo xa mixi ndee fan biraxi Nikolasi xa ɲama xa xaranyi fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="REV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16" />Na kui, wo xa tuubi, xa na mu a ra n fama nɛ gere tide na mixie bɛ n ma santidɛgɛma ra, naxan na n dɛ i.»<verse eid="REV 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17" />«Tuli na naxan bɛ, a xa a tuli mati Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi xa masenyi ra danxaniyatɔɛ ɲamae bɛ. N ‹mana› donse nɔxunxi fima nɛ geeni mixi ma, a nun gɛmɛ fiixɛ, xili nɛɛnɛ sɛbɛxi naxan ma. Mixi yo mu na xili kolon, bafe na gɛmɛ kanyi ra.»<verse eid="REV 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18" />A sɛbɛ Tiyatire danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama xa malekɛ ma, masenyi nan ya naxan fatanxi Ala xa Di ra, naxan yae yanbama alɔ tɛ, a sanyie luxi alɔ wure gbeeli raxunuxi: <verse eid="REV 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19" />«N wo xa fe rabaxi kolon, wo xa xanunteya, wo xa danxaniya, wo xa wali fanyi, wo xa tunnabɛxi, a nun wo naxan birin nabaxi a dɔnxɔɛ ra naxan gbo dangi wo xa wali singee ra.»<verse eid="REV 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20" />«Kɔnɔ fe keren na na naxan mu rafanxi n ma wo xa fe ra. Wo bara a lu Yesabela, ginɛ naxan a yɛtɛ findixi namiɲɔnmɛ ra, a xa xaranyi ti naxan n ma konyie ratantanma, alako e xa fe kobi raba, e xa subee don naxee baxi sɛrɛxɛ ra kuyee bɛ. <verse eid="REV 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21" />N bara diɲɛ alako a xa tuubi, kɔnɔ a mu tinxi a yuge ɲaaxi masarade. <verse eid="REV 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22" />Na na a ra, n a rasoma nɛ ɲaxankatɛ kui, a tan nun a yɛnɛ raba booree, xa e mu tuubi. <verse eid="REV 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23" />N fama nɛ a xa die fan faxade. Na kui, danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama birin a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan mixi bɔɲɛ nun a sondonyi matoma, n tan nan e xa fe rabaxi sare ragbilenma e ma.»<verse eid="REV 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24" />«Kɔnɔ wo tan, Tiyatireka mixi dɔnxɔɛ naxee mu na yi fe kui, naxee mu soxi Sentanɛ xa gundo kui, n mu kote gbɛtɛ dɔxɔma wo xun ma kɔrɛ. <verse eid="REV 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25" />Wo naxan sɔtɔxi, wo na suxu gben, han n fama tɛmui naxɛ. <verse eid="REV 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26" />Naxan na geeni, naxan n ma wali suxuma han a raɲɔnyi, n mangɛya fima na kanyi nan ma, a xa sie yamari. <verse eid="REV 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27" />‹A e yamarima sawuri wure daaxi nan na, a e kanama nɛ alɔ fɛɲɛ ibɔɔma ki naxɛ›, <verse eid="REV 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28" />alɔ n sɛnbɛ sɔtɔxi ki naxɛ n Baba Ala ra. N man subaxa looloe fima nɛ na kanyi ma.»<verse eid="REV 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29" />«Tuli na naxan bɛ, a xa a tuli mati Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi xa masenyi ra danxaniyatɔɛ ɲamae bɛ.»<verse eid="REV 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3" />
  <para style="s">Bataaxɛ danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama gbɛtɛe bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1" />A sɛbɛ Saradesi danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama xa malekɛ ma, masenyi nan ya naxan fatanxi Isa ra, naxan Xaxili solofere yamarima, tunbui solofere suxuxi naxan yi ra:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:1">«N wo xa wali kolon. Mixi ɲɔxɔ a ma a wo ɲiɲɛ na a ra, kɔnɔ wo bara faxa. <verse eid="REV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2" />Wo naxa yanfa, wo xa wo bore ralimaniya, naxee na faxɛ kira xɔn, barima nde luxi wo xa wali ra n Marigi Ala bɛ. <verse eid="REV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3" />Wo xa ratu na masenyi ma, wo naxan masɔtɔxi, wo naxan mɛxi. Wo xa a ragata wo bɔɲɛ kui, wo xa tuubi. Xa wo mu wo ɲɛngi sa yi xɔn, n fama nɛ waxati nde kui wo mu naxan kolon, na fa findi tɛrɛnna ra wo bɛ alɔ muɲɛti fa tɛmui. <verse eid="REV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4" />Kɔnɔ mixi ndee na Saradesi naxee mu nɔxɔxi fe ɲaaxi ra. Nee fama nɛ ɲɛrɛde n sɛɛti ma, donma fiixɛ ragoroxi e ma, barima na nan findixi e xa wali sare ra.»<verse eid="REV 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5" />«Naxan na geeni, donma fiixɛ ragoroma a ma. N mu a xili bama simaya buki kui, n a xa fe falama nɛ n Baba Ala bɛ a xa malekɛe ya xɔri. <verse eid="REV 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6" />Tuli na naxan bɛ, a xa a tuli mati Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi xa masenyi ra danxaniyatɔɛ ɲamae bɛ.»<verse eid="REV 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7" />A sɛbɛ Filadelifiya danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama xa malekɛ ma, masenyi nan ya naxan fatanxi Sɛniyɛntɔɛ nɔndi falɛ ra, Dawuda xa saabi na naxan yi ra, naxan naadɛ rabima mixi mu nɔ a balande, naxan naadɛ balanma mixi mu nɔ a rabide: <verse eid="REV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8" />«N wo xa wali kolon. N a kolon wo sɛnbɛ mu gbo, kɔnɔ wo bara n ma masenyi rabatu, wo mu n yanfa. Na kui, n bara naadɛ nde rabi wo ya ra, mixi mu nɔma naxan balande. <verse eid="REV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9" />N fama nɛ mixie sade wo bɛlɛxɛ naxee a falama e yɛtɛ bɛ a Yuwifie, kɔnɔ e findixi Sentanɛ xa ɲama nan na. E na wule nan falafe. N fama nɛ e ra, e xa e magoro wo bɛ, e xa a kolon wo rafan n ma. <verse eid="REV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10" />Wo to n ma masenyi rabatu tunnabɛxi kui, n fan wo ratangama nɛ na waxati xɔrɔxɔɛ ma naxan fama duniɲa lide, a fa duniɲa mixi birin mato. <verse eid="REV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11" />A gbe mu luxi n xa fa. Wo naxa wo xa danxaniya bɛɲin, alako mixi yo naxa wo sare fanyi ba wo yi ra.»<verse eid="REV 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12" />«Naxan na geeni, n a findima n Marigi Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kinki ra, a xa lu mɛnni abadan. N nan n Marigi Ala xili nun n Marigi Ala xa taa xili sɛbɛma nɛ a ma. Na taa findixi Darisalamu nɛɛnɛ nan na, Ala naxan nagoroma kelife koore ma. N nan n xili nɛɛnɛ fan sɛbɛma nɛ a ma. <verse eid="REV 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13" />Tuli na naxan bɛ, a xa a tuli mati Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi xa masenyi ra danxaniyatɔɛ ɲamae bɛ.»<verse eid="REV 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14" />A sɛbɛ Layodiseya danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama xa malekɛ ma, masenyi nan ya naxan fatanxi Isa ra, naxan findixi Ala sago rakamali ra, a xa seede laxixɛ, Ala xa daalie daaxi naxan saabui ra: <verse eid="REV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15" />«N wo xa wali kolon. Wo mu xinbeli, wo mu wolen. A xɔli n ma wo xa natɛ tongo, wo xa xinbeli, xa na mu a ra wo xa wolen. <verse eid="REV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16" />Wo to fa luxi a tagi, wo mu wolen, wo mu xinbeli, n wo raboloma nɛ. <verse eid="REV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17" />Wo bara a fala, ‹Bannamixie nan muxu ra, muxu hayi mu na fefe ma.› Wo mu a kolon a wo findixi tɔɔrɔmixie nan na, a nun misikiinɛe, setaree, dɔnxuie, nun mixi mageli. <verse eid="REV 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18" />N marasi naxan fima wo ma, wo xa xɛɛma fanyi sara n ma, xɛɛma naxan gbi baxi tɛ ra, alako wo xa findi bannamixie yati ra. Wo xa donma fiixɛ sara n ma, wo xa na ragoro wo ma, alako wo xa ba tixi wo mageli ra, yaagi xa ba wo ma. Wo man xa ya seri sara n ma, alako wo xa fe igbɛ. <verse eid="REV 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19" />N nan n xanuntenyie nan xuruma, n e matinxin. Wo xa wakili, wo xa tuubi. <verse eid="REV 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20" />N tixi naadɛ ra, n na a kɔnkɔnfe. Xa mixi nde n xui mɛ, a naadɛ rabi n bɛ, n soma nɛ a xɔnyi, muxu fa muxu dɛge yire keren.»<verse eid="REV 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21" />«Naxan na geeni, a luma n sɛɛti ma n ma kibanyi kui, alɔ n tan fan to geeni, n fa n magoro n Baba Ala sɛɛti ma a xa kibanyi kui. <verse eid="REV 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22" />Tuli na naxan bɛ, a xa a tuli mati Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi xa masenyi ra danxaniyatɔɛ ɲamae bɛ.»<verse eid="REV 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4" />
  <para style="s">Ala xa kibanyi ariyanna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1" />Na birin to dangi, n naxa ariyanna naadɛ rabixi to koore ma. N man naxa xui nde mɛ, n nu bara naxan singe mɛ. A sɛnbɛ nu gbo alɔ sara. A naxa a masen n bɛ, «I xa te bebiri, n xa fe masen i bɛ naxan fama rabade.» <verse eid="REV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2" />Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi naxa n suxu keren na. N naxa kibanyi nde to ariyanna, mangɛ magoroxi a kui. <verse eid="REV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3" />A nɔrɛ nu yanbama alɔ gɛmɛ tofanyi mayilenxie, senkui tofanyi nu na a xa kibanyi rabilinyi.<verse eid="REV 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4" />Kibanyi mɔxɔɲɛn nun naani nu na Ala xa kibanyi rabilinyi, fori mɔxɔɲɛn nun naani magoroxi e kui. Donma fiixɛ nu ragoroxi e ma, mangɛ katanyi xɛɛma daaxi nu saxi e xun na. <verse eid="REV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5" />Seyamakɔnyi nun galanyi xuie nu minima kibanyi kui. Lanpui solofere nu dɛxɛma kibanyi ya i. Nee misaalixi Ala Xaxili kamalixi nan na. <verse eid="REV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6" />Baa tinse fan nu na kibanyi ya i.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:6">Nimase naani nu na Ala xa kibanyi rabilinyi, yae nu na e yatagi nun e kobe ma. <verse eid="REV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7" />Nimase singe nu maniyaxi yɛtɛ nan na, a firin nde nu maniyaxi ningeyɔrɛ nan na, a saxan nde nu maniyaxi adamadi nan na, a naani nde nu maniyaxi xaruma nan na, naxan ɲɛrɛma koore ma. <verse eid="REV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8" />Na nimase naani birin, gabutenyi senni nu na e ma. Yae fan nu na e bɛ yire birin, e gabutenyie fari nun e bun ma. Kɔɛ nun yanyi e nu luma a fala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 4:8">«Marigi Ala sɛniyɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 4:8">Marigi Ala sɛniyɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 4:8">Marigi Ala sɛniyɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 4:8">A findixi Sɛnbɛ Kanyi nan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 4:8">naxan na xoro, to, nun tina.»<verse eid="REV 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9" />Na nimase naani nu fa Mangɛ matɔxɔ, e mangɛ binya naxan magoroxi kibanyi kui, e mangɛ tantu, naxan ɲiɲɛ a ra abadan, <verse eid="REV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10" />na fori mɔxɔɲɛn nun naani, e felenma bɔxi ma Mangɛ ya i, naxan magoroxi kibanyi kui, e fa a batu naxan ɲiɲɛ a ra abadan. E nu e xa mangɛ katanyi ba e xun na, e nu e sa kibanyi san na, e nu fa a fala, <verse eid="REV 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11" />«Muxu Marigi Ala, matɔxɔɛ, binyɛ, nun sɛnbɛ na i tan nan bɛ, barima i tan nan se birin daaxi, i tan nan na birin ɲanigexi, i tan nan na birin nagirixi.»<verse eid="REV 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5" />
  <para style="s">Buki nde rabife</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1" />Na dangi xanbi, n naxa Ala to a xa kibanyi kui, buki nde nu na a xɔnyɛ, sɛbɛli tixi a kui nun a fari, a mabalanxi a balanse solofere ra. <verse eid="REV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2" />N naxa malekɛ sɛnbɛma nde to, a a falama a xui itexi ra, «Nde nɔma yi buki rabide, nde nɔma a balansee bade a ma?» <verse eid="REV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3" />Nimase yo mu nu na koore ma, bɔxi ma, xa na mu a ra bɔxi bun ma, naxan nu nɔma na buki rabide, a a kui mato. <verse eid="REV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4" />Na kui, n naxa wa a gbegbe ra, barima nimase yo mu nu na, naxan nu nɔma na buki rabide, a a kui mato. <verse eid="REV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5" />Fori nde naxa a fala n bɛ, «I naxa wa, Yuda bɔnsɔɛ xa yɛtɛ, naxan findixi Dawuda bɔnsɔɛ ra, a bara geeni. A tan nan nɔma na buki nun a balanse solofere rabide.»<verse eid="REV 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6" />Na tɛmui n naxa Yɛxɛɛyɔrɛ to a tixi kibanyi nun na nimase naani nun na forie tagi. Na Yɛxɛɛyɔrɛ nu luxi nɛ alɔ a kɔn naxabaxi. Feri solofere nun ya solofere nu na a bɛ, naxee misaalixi Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi kamalixi ra, naxan nu bara xɛɛ duniɲa yire birin ma. <verse eid="REV 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7" />Yɛxɛɛyɔrɛ naxa a maso Ala ra, naxan nu magoroxi kibanyi kui, a fa buki rasuxu Ala yirefanyi xɔnyɛ.<verse eid="REV 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8" />A to buki masɔtɔ, na nimase naani nun na fori mɔxɔɲɛn nun naani, e naxa suyidi Yɛxɛɛyɔrɛ bɛ. Kɔra nu na e birin yi ra, a nun surayi sase xɛɛma daaxi naxee rafexi surayi ra, naxan misaalixi sɛniyɛntɔɛe xa Ala maxandie ra. <verse eid="REV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9" />E naxa bɛɛti nɛɛnɛ nde ba, e nu a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:9">«I tan nan daxa yi buki tongode,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:9">i tan nan daxa a balansee rabide,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:9">barima i bara i yɛtɛ ba sɛrɛxɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:9">i bara adamadie xunsara Ala bɛ i wuli saabui ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:9">adamadi naxee kelixi bɔnsɔɛ birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:9">naxee xui birin falama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:9">naxee fatanxi ɲamanɛ nun si birin na.<verse eid="REV 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10" />I bara na adamadie findi sɛrɛxɛdubɛe ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:10">muxu Marigi Ala bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:10">I bara e raso Ala xa mangɛya niini bun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:10">E fama nɛ duniɲa yamaride.»<verse eid="REV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11" />Na tɛmui n naxa malekɛ wulu wulu wuyaxi to, n naxa e xui mɛ Ala xa kibanyi, na forie, nun na nimasee rabilinyi. <verse eid="REV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12" />E naxa a fala e xui itexi ra, «Yɛxɛɛyɔrɛ naxan baxi sɛrɛxɛ ra, a daxa a xa sɛnbɛ, bannaya, lɔnni, nɔɛ, binyɛ, matɔxɔɛ, nun tantui sɔtɔ.» <verse eid="REV 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13" />Nimase naxan birin na koore ma, bɔxi fari, bɔxi bun ma, baa ma, a nun daalise birin, n nee birin xui mɛ nɛ, e nu fa a fala, «Matɔxɔɛ, binyɛ, tantui, nun sɛnbɛ na Ala bɛ naxan magoroxi kibanyi kui, a nun Yɛxɛɛyɔrɛ bɛ abadan.» <verse eid="REV 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14" />Na nimase naani naxa a ratin, «Amina.» Forie naxa e felen bɔxi ma, e Ala nun Yɛxɛɛyɔrɛ batu.<verse eid="REV 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6" />
  <para style="s">Buki balansee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1" />N naxa Yɛxɛɛyɔrɛ to buki balanse singe rabi ra. N naxa nimase nde xui mɛ kelife na nimase naani tagi. A xui sɛnbɛ nu gbo alɔ galanyi. A naxa a fala, «Fa.» <verse eid="REV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2" />Na dangi xanbi, n naxa soe fiixɛ nde to, xali suxuxi a ragima yi, mangɛ katanyi saxi a xun ma, a fa siga xunnakeli kui, a man xa sa geeni.<verse eid="REV 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3" />A to buki balanse firin nde rabi, n naxa nimase firin nde xui mɛ. A naxa a fala, «Fa.» <verse eid="REV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4" />Soe gbeeli naxa mini. E naxa a ragima yamari a xa bɔɲɛsa ba duniɲa kui, alako adamadie xa nu e bore kɔn naxaba. Santidɛgɛma belebele naxa so a yi ra.<verse eid="REV 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5" />A to buki balanse saxan nde rabi, n naxa nimase saxan nde xui mɛ. A naxa a fala, «Fa.» N naxa soe fɔɔrɛ to. Sikeeli nu suxuxi a ragima yi ra. <verse eid="REV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6" />N naxa xui nde mɛ na nimase naani tagi, «Mɛngi kilo keren sare lanma lɔxɔɛ keren wali sare nan ma. Fundenyi maniyɛ kilo saxan lanma lɔxɔɛ keren wali sare nan ma. I naxa ture nun wɛni xun nakana.»<verse eid="REV 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7" />A to buki balanse naani nde rabi, n naxa na nimase naani nde xui mɛ. A naxa a fala, «Fa.» <verse eid="REV 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8" />N naxa soe burɛxɛ xinde daaxi to. A ragima xili nɛ «Faxɛ,» laaxira nu biraxi a fɔxɔ ra. Nɔɛ naxa so e yi ra duniɲa sɛɛti keren xun ma a sɛɛti naani ya ma, alako e xa mixie faxa santidɛgɛma ra, kaamɛ ra, wuganyi ra, a nun sube xaaɲɛxie ra, naxee na wula i.<verse eid="REV 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9" />A to buki balanse suuli nde rabi, n naxa mixie nii to sɛrɛxɛbade bun ma, mixi naxee kɔn nu bara raxaba barima e nu birama Ala xa masenyi nan fɔxɔ ra, e findi a xa seedee ra. <verse eid="REV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10" />E naxa a fala e xui itexi ra, «Marigi sɛniyɛnxi nɔndi falɛ, i buma han tɛmui mundun fafe ra kiiti sade, alako muxu gbe xa ɲɔxɔ duniɲa mixie ma naxee bara muxu faxa?» <verse eid="REV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11" />Donma kuye fiixɛ naxa so e birin yi ra. Mixi nde naxa a fala e bɛ e xa mamɛ ti sinden, han e walibooree nun e ngaxakerenyie xasabi xa kamali naxee lanma e xa faxa alɔ e tan.<verse eid="REV 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12" />A to buki balanse senni nde rabi, bɔxi naxa sɛrɛn sɛnbɛ ra, soge naxa ifɔɔrɔ alɔ sunnun donma fɔɔrɛ, kike naxa lu alɔ wuli, <verse eid="REV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13" />tunbuie naxa bira bɔxi ma, alɔ foye belebele xɔrɛ bogi rabirama ki naxɛ. <verse eid="REV 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14" />Koore naxa ba na, alɔ kɛɛdi makuntanma ki naxɛ a xa ragata. Geyae nun surie fan naxa keli e yire. <verse eid="REV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15" />Duniɲa mangɛe, kuntigie, sɔɔri yareratie, bannae, sɛnbɛmae, konyie, nun lasirie, e birin naxa e nɔxun yilie kui a nun geya gɛmɛe longori ra. <verse eid="REV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16" />E nu fa a fala geyae nun fanyee bɛ, «Wo bira muxu ma, wo xa muxu nɔxun Ala ma, naxan magoroxi mangɛ kibanyi kui, a nun Yɛxɛɛyɔrɛ xa xɔnɛ ma.» <verse eid="REV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17" />E xa xɔnɛ lɔxɔɛ xungbe bara a li. Nde nɔma a yɛtɛ ratangade na ma?<verse eid="REV 6:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7" />
  <para style="s">Ala xa ɲama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1" />Na dangi xanbi, n naxa malekɛ naani to, e tixi duniɲa tunxui naani ra. E nu duniɲa foye naani ratima, alako foye naxa mini bɔxi ma, baa ma, xa na mu sansie ma. <verse eid="REV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2" />N naxa malekɛ gbɛtɛ fan to a kelife sogetede mabiri, Ala Ɲiɲɛ xa tɔnxuma suxuxi a yi ra. A naxa a masen a xui itexi ra, na malekɛ naanie bɛ, naxee nu yamarixi fe xɔnɛ rabade bɔxi nun baa ra, <verse eid="REV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3" />«Wo naxa wo bɛlɛxɛ din bɔxi nun baa nun wuri bilie ra sinden, han muxu xa gɛ tɔxunma sade Ala xa walikɛe tigi ma. <verse eid="REV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4" />N naxa na walikɛe kɔnti xasabi mɛ, Ala xa tɔnxuma saxi naxee ma. E findi mixi wulu kɛmɛ wulu tongo naani nun wulu naani nan na, kelife Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ birin ya ma.<verse eid="REV 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5" />Mixi wulu fu nun firin Yuda bɔnsɔɛ ya ma naxee matɔnxumaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:5">mixi wulu fu nun firin Ruben bɔnsɔɛ ya ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:5">mixi wulu fu nun firin Gadi bɔnsɔɛ ya ma,<verse eid="REV 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6" />mixi wulu fu nun firin Aseri bɔnsɔɛ ya ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:6">mixi wulu fu nun firin Nafatali bɔnsɔɛ ya ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:6">mixi wulu fu nun firin Manasi bɔnsɔɛ ya ma,<verse eid="REV 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7" />mixi wulu fu nun firin Simeyɔn bɔnsɔɛ ya ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:7">mixi wulu fu nun firin Lewi bɔnsɔɛ ya ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:7">mixi wulu fu nun firin Isakari bɔnsɔɛ ya ma,<verse eid="REV 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8" />mixi wulu fu nun firin Sabulon bɔnsɔɛ ya ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:8">mixi wulu fu nun firin Yusufu bɔnsɔɛ ya ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:8">mixi wulu fu nun firin Bunyamin bɔnsɔɛ ya ma naxee matɔnxumaxi.»<verse eid="REV 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9" />Na dangi xanbi, n naxa ɲama gbegbe to, naxan mu nu nɔma kɔntide, kelife si birin, bɔnsɔɛ birin, xabilɛ birin, nun xui birin. E nu tixi Ala xa kibanyi nun Yɛxɛɛyɔrɛ ya i, donma kuye fiixɛ ragoroxi e ma, tugi fɛnsɛ suxuxi e yi. <verse eid="REV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10" />E naxa a masen e xui itexi ra, «Kisi na muxu Marigi Ala bɛ naxan magoroxi kibanyi kui, nun Yɛxɛɛyɔrɛ bɛ.» <verse eid="REV 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11" />Malekɛe nu tixi kibanyi, forie nun nimase naanie rabilinyi, e naxa e yatagi rafelen bɔxi ma, e Ala batu <verse eid="REV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12" />yi fe falɛ ra, «Amina. Matɔxɔɛ, nɔrɛ, lɔnni, tantui, binyɛ, nɔɛ fanyi, nun sɛnbɛ na muxu Marigi Ala nan bɛ abadan. Amina.»<verse eid="REV 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13" />Na tɛmui fori nde naxa n maxɔrin, «Nde na na mixie ra donma fiixɛ ragoroxi naxee ma? E kelixi minden?» <verse eid="REV 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14" />N naxa a yaabi, «N Marigi, i tan nan a kolon.» A naxa a masen n bɛ, «Mixie nan e ra, naxee kelixi na ɲaxankatɛ xungbe kui. E bara e xa donmae xa Yɛxɛɛyɔrɛ wuli ra, na nan a toxi e xa donmae fiixɛxi. <verse eid="REV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15" />Na nan a toxi e tixi Ala xa kibanyi ya i, e fa a batu kɔɛ nun yanyi a xa hɔrɔmɔlingira kui. E na Ala xa niini bun ma, naxan magoroxi kibanyi kui. <verse eid="REV 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16" />Kaamɛ nun ye xɔli mu e suxuma sɔnɔn, soge nun kuye fure mu e tɔɔrɔma sɔnɔn, <verse eid="REV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17" />barima Yɛxɛɛyɔrɛ naxan na kibanyi sɛɛti ma, na nan fama e dɛgede, a e xun ti kisi ye yire ra. Ala fama nɛ e yaye birin nafurukude.»<verse eid="REV 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8" />
  <para style="s">Buki balanse solofere nde rabife</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1" />A to buki balanse solofere nde rabi, kuye naxa lu yen waxati tagi ɲɔndɔn bun ma. <verse eid="REV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2" />N naxa malekɛ solofere to, naxee nu tixi Ala ya i, sara solofere naxa so e yi ra.<verse eid="REV 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3" />Malekɛ gbɛtɛ naxa fa, a ti sɛrɛxɛbade fari, surayi sase xɛɛma daaxi nu na a yi ra. E naxa surayi gbegbe so a yi ra, a nun sɛniyɛntɔɛ birin xa Ala maxandie ra. A naxa na surayi gan sɛrɛxɛbade xɛɛma daaxi ma Ala xa kibanyi ya i. <verse eid="REV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4" />Surayi tuuri naxa te Ala ya i, a nun sɛniyɛntɔɛ xa Ala maxandie, kelife malekɛ bɛlɛxɛ. <verse eid="REV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5" />Malekɛ naxa surayi ganse tongo, a naxa sɛrɛxɛbade tɛ sa a kui, a fa a woli duniɲa ma. Galanyie naxa bula, xuie naxa mɛ, seyamakɔnyie naxa mini, bɔxi naxa sɛrɛn.<verse eid="REV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6" />Malekɛ solofere, sarae nu na naxee yi ra, nee naxa keli, e xa sarae fe. <verse eid="REV 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7" />Malekɛ singe to a xa sara fe, balabalanyi nun tɛ naxa goro duniɲa ma, e masunbuxi wuli ra. Bɔxi itaxunxi saxan na, na dɔxɔde saxan nde naxa gan. Wuri bilie itaxunxi saxan na, na dɔxɔde saxan nde naxa gan. Ɲooge xinde birin naxa gan.<verse eid="REV 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8" />Malekɛ firin nde to sara fe, geya xungbe, tɛ naxan ganfe, a naxa sin baa ma. Baa itaxunxi saxan na, na dɔxɔde keren naxa findi wuli ra. <verse eid="REV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9" />Baa nimasee itaxunxi saxan na, na dɔxɔde saxan nde naxa faxa. Kunkuie itaxunxi saxan na, na dɔxɔde saxan nde fan naxa kana.<verse eid="REV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10" />Malekɛ saxan nde to sara fe, tunbui dɛxɛxi belebele naxa bira. Xuree itaxunxi saxan na, na tunbui naxa bira na saxan nde ma a nun dulonyie ma. <verse eid="REV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11" />Na tunbui xili nɛ «Xɔnɛ.» Duniɲa ye itaxunxi saxan na, na dɔxɔde saxan nde to findi xɔnɛ ra, adamadi gbegbe naxa faxa na ma.<verse eid="REV 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12" />Malekɛ naani nde to sara fe, soge, kike, nun tunbui itaxunxi saxan na, na dɔxɔde saxan nde naxa findi dimi ra. Nde naxa ba yanyi nun kɔɛ xa naiyalanyi ra.<verse eid="REV 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13" />Na tɛmui n naxa xaruma nde xui mɛ koore ma, a naxa a fala a xui itexi ra, «Ɲaxankatɛ na duniɲa mixie bɛ, ɲaxankatɛ na e bɛ sara fe tɛmui, malekɛ saxanyie fama naxee fede.»<verse eid="REV 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9" />
  <para style="s">Malekɛe xa sara fe dɔnxɔɛe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1" />Malekɛ suuli nde to sara fe, n naxa tunbui to bira ra bɔxi kelife koore ma. E naxa yili tilinxi naadɛ saabi so a yi ra. <verse eid="REV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2" />A naxa na yili naadɛ rabi, tuuri gbegbe naxa mini a kui alɔ tɛ belebele tuuri han soge naxa makoto, kuye naxa idimi. <verse eid="REV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3" />Tugumie naxa mini tuuri kui, e fa goro bɔxi ma. E nu bara sɛnbɛ sɔtɔ alɔ tali. <verse eid="REV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4" />E nu bara yaamari sɔtɔ a falafe ra e naxa din bɔxi ɲooge ra, nun se xinde, a nun wuri bili yo ra. A nu lanma e xa adamadie gbansan nan tɔɔrɔ Ala xa tɔnxuma mu saxi naxee tigi ma. <verse eid="REV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5" />E nu bara yaamari sɔtɔ a falafe ra e naxa adamadie faxa, e xa e tɔɔrɔ tun kike suuli bun ma. E nu mixi bunma nɛ alɔ tali. <verse eid="REV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6" />Na lɔxɔɛe, mixie faxɛ xɔli mawama nɛ na tɔɔrɛ xa fe ra, kɔnɔ e mu nɔma faxade. Faxɛ xɔli e suxuma nɛ, kɔnɔ faxɛ a makuyama nɛ e ra.<verse eid="REV 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7" />Na tugumie maniyaxi soe nan na, naxee rawalima gere kui. Mangɛ katanyi xɛɛma daaxi nu dusuxi e xun na, e yatagie nu luxi nɛ alɔ mixie. <verse eid="REV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8" />E xunsɛxɛ nu luxi nɛ alɔ ginɛe xunsɛxɛ. E ɲinyie nu luxi nɛ alɔ yɛtɛ ɲinyie. <verse eid="REV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9" />Wure makantase nu na e kanke ma, e gabutenyie nu xui raminima alɔ sɔɔri ragise xui, soe gbegbe naxan bɛndunma. <verse eid="REV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10" />E xuli nu mixi bunma alɔ tali, na xɔnɛ nu fa mixi tɔɔrɔ kike suuli bun ma. <verse eid="REV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11" />E xa yarerati nu findixi na yili tilinxi xa malekɛ nan na, naxan xili nu falaxi Eburu xui «Abadon,» a nu falaxi Girɛki xui «Apoliyon,» na nan na ki «Yire Kanɛ.» <verse eid="REV 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12" />Ɲaxankatɛ singe bara dangi, firin nan luxi.<verse eid="REV 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13" />Malekɛ senni nde to sara fe, n naxa xui nde mɛ kelife sɛrɛxɛbade xɛɛma daaxi feri tunxun naanie ma, naxan na Ala ya i. <verse eid="REV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14" />Na xui naxa a fala malekɛ senni nde bɛ, sara nu suxuxi naxan yi, «Na malekɛ naani rabɛɲin, naxee xirixi Efirati xure ma.» <verse eid="REV 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15" />Na malekɛ naanie nu na waxati yati nan mamɛma, alako e xa adamadi ndee faxa. Adamadie itaxunxi saxan na, e xa na dɔxɔde saxan nde faxa. E naxa fulun na wali xili ma.<verse eid="REV 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16" />Na soe ragi gali xasabi nu dangi miliyɔn kɛmɛ firin na. N naxa na kɔnti mɛ. <verse eid="REV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17" />Na laamatunyi kui n naxa na soee nun e ragie to. E kanke makantase nu maɲingixi nɛ a gbeeli, a fɔɔrɛ, nun a nerefunyi daaxi. Soe xunyie nu luxi alɔ yɛtɛe xunyi. Tɛ, tuuri, nun soda nu minima e dɛ kui. <verse eid="REV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18" />Duniɲa mixi itaxunxi saxan na, na dɔxɔde saxan nde naxa faxa na gbaloe saxanyi mɔɔli ra: tɛ, tuuri, nun soda naxan nu minima e dɛ kui. <verse eid="REV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19" />Na soee sɛnbɛ nu na e dɛ nun e xuli nan kui. E xuli nu maniyaxi bɔximase nan na, xunyi nu na a bɛ naxan mixi tɔɔrɔma. <verse eid="REV 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20" />Mixi naxee mu faxa na gbaloe saabui ra, e mu gbilen e xa wali kobie fɔxɔ ra. E nu ɲinnɛe nan batuma, a nun kuyee xɛɛma daaxi, gbeti daaxi, wure gbeeli daaxi, gɛmɛ daaxi, nun wuri daaxi, naxee mu nɔma se tode, naxee mu nɔma fe mɛde, naxee mu nɔma ɲɛrɛde. <verse eid="REV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21" />Na mixie mu gbilen e xa faxa tife fɔxɔ ra, e xa manduru walie, e xa fe ɲaaxie, nun e xa muɲɛe xa fe fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="REV 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10" />
  <para style="s">Malekɛe xa buki lanmadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1" />N naxa malekɛ sɛnbɛma gbɛtɛ to goro ra kelife koore nuxui kui. Senkui nu na a xunyi rabilinyi, a yatagi nu yanbama alɔ soge, a sanyie nu maniyaxi tɛ nan na. <verse eid="REV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2" />Buki lanmadi nu na a bɛlɛxɛ, a rabixi. Malekɛ yirefanyi sanyi nu tixi baa fari, boore fan nu tixi xare ma. <verse eid="REV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3" />A naxa a xui ramini sɛnbɛ ra, naxan maniya yɛtɛ xui ra. Galanyi solofere naxa a xui ratin. <verse eid="REV 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4" />Na galanyi solofere xui to mini, n nu wama na sɛbɛfe, kɔnɔ xui nde naxa keli koore ma, a a fala n bɛ, «Galanyi solofere xa masenyi nɔxun, i naxa a sɛbɛ.»<verse eid="REV 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5" />Malekɛ naxan sanyi nu tixi baa nun xare fari, a naxa a yirefanyi bɛlɛxɛ itala koore ma, <verse eid="REV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6" />a fa a kali Ala ra naxan ɲiɲɛ a ra abadan, naxan koore, bɔxi, nun baa daa, a nun e kui se birin. A naxa a masen a waxati mu fa dugundife sɔnɔn. <verse eid="REV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7" />Malekɛ solofere nde na a xa sara fe tɛmui naxɛ, Ala gundo fama nɛ kamalide alɔ a nu bara a masen a xa konyi namiɲɔnmɛe bɛ ki naxɛ.<verse eid="REV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8" />Na xui naxan nu bara wɔyɛn n bɛ kelife koore ma, na man naxa a masen n bɛ, «Siga, i sa buki lanmadi rabixi tongo naxan na malekɛ bɛlɛxɛ, malekɛ naxan sanyi tixi baa nun xare fari.» <verse eid="REV 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9" />N naxa siga na malekɛ yire, n fa a maxandi a xa na buki lanmadi so n yi ra. A naxa a fala n bɛ, «I xa a tongo, a don. A xɔnɛ rasoma nɛ i furi, kɔnɔ a ɲɔxunma nɛ i dɛ kui alɔ kumi.» <verse eid="REV 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10" />N naxa na buki lanmadi tongo malekɛ bɛlɛxɛ, n naxa a don. A nu ɲɔxun n dɛ kui alɔ kumi, kɔnɔ a to n furi kui li, a naxa findi xɔnɛ ra. <verse eid="REV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11" />Na tɛmui a naxa a fala n bɛ, «A lanma i man xa wɔyɛn Ala xili ra ɲamanɛe xa fe ra, sie xa fe ra, xui gbɛtɛ falɛe xa fe ra, nun mangɛ gbegbe xa fe ra.»<verse eid="REV 10:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11" />
  <para style="s">Taa sɛniyɛnxi nun seede firinyie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1" />Malekɛ nde naxa se maniyase wuri daaxi so n yi ra, a nu fa a fala, «Keli, i xa Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi nun sɛrɛxɛbade maniya, i man xa batulae kɔnti. <verse eid="REV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2" />I naxa yire maniya naxan na tande, barima si gbɛtɛe fama mɛnni nan tongode, e fa taa sɛniyɛnxi kana kike tongo naani nun firin bun ma. <verse eid="REV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3" />N masenyi soma n ma seede firinyie nan yi ra, e naxan tima n xili ra xi wulu keren xi kɛmɛ firin nun xi tongo senni bun ma, sunnun donma ragoroxi e ma. <verse eid="REV 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4" />Na seede firinyie misaalixi oliwi wuri firin nan na, a nun lanpui firin naxee tixi Daali Marigi ya i. <verse eid="REV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5" />Xa mixi nde fa wa fe ɲaaxi rabafe e ra, tɛ nan minima e dɛ kui, a e yaxuie xa fe kana. Iyo, xa mixi nde wama e tɔɔrɔfe, na kanyi faxama na mɔɔli nan na. <verse eid="REV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6" />Sɛnbɛ na e bɛ koore balanfe ra, alako tunɛ naxa fa e xa namiɲɔnmɛ wali raba tɛmui. Sɛnbɛ na e bɛ ye masarafe wuli ra, a nun fure ɲaaxi mɔɔli wuyaxi raminife duniɲa ma e wama a xɔn ma tɛmui naxɛ.»<verse eid="REV 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7" />Na seede firinyie na gɛ e xa seedeɲɔxɔya ra, na sube naxan minixi yili tilinxi kui, na nan e gerema, a nɔ e ra, a e faxa. <verse eid="REV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8" />E furee sama nɛ taa belebele malande, e Marigi banban wuri magalanbuxi ma dɛnnaxɛ. Na taa maniyaxi Sodoma nan na, xa na mu a ra Misira. <verse eid="REV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9" />Mixie kelima si, bɔnsɔɛ, xui, nun ɲamanɛ birin nan ma, e fa e fure matode xi saxan nun a tagi bun ma. E mu tinma mixi xa e ragata.<verse eid="REV 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10" />Mixie fama sɛɛwade duniɲa ma na mixi firinyie nan faxafe ra, barima na namiɲɔnmɛ firinyie nu bara mixie tɔɔrɔ. E se ndee fi e booree ma na sɛɛwɛ xa fe ra.<verse eid="REV 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11" />Na xi saxan nun a tagi to dangi, Ala naxa nii raso e fate, e man xa ti e sanyie xun na. Naxan birin e to, e naxa gaaxu ki fanyi ra. <verse eid="REV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12" />Na seedee naxa xui sɛnbɛma nde mɛ kelife koore ma a falafe ra, «Wo xa te han be.» E naxa te koore ma nuxui kui e yaxuie ya xɔri. <verse eid="REV 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13" />Na tɛmui, bɔxi naxa sɛrɛn. Taa itaxunxi fu ra, na dɔxɔde fu nde naxa bira. Na bɔxi xa sɛrɛnyi naxa mixi wulu solofere faxa, mixi dɔnxɔɛe naxa kaaba, e fa Ala matɔxɔ, naxan na koore ma.<verse eid="REV 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14" />Ɲaxankatɛ firin nde bara dangi, a gbe mu luxi a saxan nde fan xa fa.<verse eid="REV 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15" />Malekɛ solofere nde to sara fe, xui itexie naxa mini koore ma a falafe ra, «Mangɛya naxan nu na duniɲa ma, na bara findi muxu Marigi nun a xa Mixi Sugandixi gbe ra. A xa mangɛya buma nɛ abadan.»<verse eid="REV 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16" />Na fori mɔxɔɲɛn nun naani, naxee nu magoroxi kibanyie kui Ala ya i, e naxa e felen bɔxi ma, e Ala batu. <verse eid="REV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17" />E naxa a fala, «Muxu bara muxu Marigi Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanyi tantu, naxan nu na singe han to, barima i bara i sɛnbɛ magaaxuxi ramini, i xa mangɛya xa ti duniɲa. <verse eid="REV 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18" />Ɲamanɛe nu bara xɔnɔ, kɔnɔ i xa xɔnɛ bara e li, kiiti waxati bara fa. Na kui, mixi faxaxie makiitima nɛ, i xa konyi namiɲɔnmɛe e sare sɔtɔma nɛ, a nun sɛniyɛntɔɛe, nun naxee gaaxuma i xili ya ra, dimɛdie nun forie. Naxee bara duniɲa kana, e fan xun nakanama nɛ.» <verse eid="REV 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19" />Ala xa hɔrɔmɔlingira naxan na koore ma, a naxa rabi, birin naxa Ala xa saatɛ kankira to naxan na hɔrɔmɔlingira kui. Na tɛmui seyamakɔnyie, galanyi xuie, bɔxi sɛrɛnyi, nun balabalanyi belebele naxa mini sɛnbɛ ra.<verse eid="REV 11:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12" />
  <para style="s">Ginɛ, dimɛdi, nun sube magaaxuxi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1" />Tɔnxuma belebele naxa mini koore ma. Soge nu na na ginɛ nde rabilinyi, kike nu na a sanyi bun ma, tunbui fu nun firin nu na a xun na alɔ mangɛ katanyi. <verse eid="REV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2" />A nu na gbelegbelefe tɔɔrɛ kui, barima a nu na di barife a tɛɛgɛxi naxan ma.<verse eid="REV 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3" />Tɔnxuma gbɛtɛ fan naxa mini koore ma. Sube magaaxuxi xungbe nde nu na, a gbeelixi alɔ tɛ, xunyi solofere nu na a bɛ, a nun feri fu. Mangɛ katanyie nu na a xunyi solofere birin fari. <verse eid="REV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4" />Tunbui itaxunxi saxan na, a xuli naxa din na dɔxɔde saxan nde ra, a e woli bɔxi ma.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 12:4">Sube magaaxuxi naxa keli, a fa ti ginɛ ya i naxan nu na di barife, alako a xa na diyɔrɛ don. <verse eid="REV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5" />Ginɛ naxa di xɛmɛ bari, naxan fama si birin yamaride a xɔrɔxɔɛ ra. Ginɛ to di bari, na di naxa te Ala yire, a xa mangɛ kibanyi na dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="REV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6" />Ginɛ naxa a gi, a siga yire nde gbengberenyi ma Ala nu bara naxan yailan a bɛ, alako a xa balo mɛnni xi wulu keren xi kɛmɛ firin nun tongo senni bun ma.<verse eid="REV 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7" />Gere naxa mini koore ma. Minkayilu nun a xa malekɛe naxa na sube magaaxuxi nun a xa malekɛe gere, <verse eid="REV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8" />kɔnɔ na sube mu nɔ Minkayilu nun a xa malekɛe ra. Na kui, sube magaaxuxi nun a xa malekɛe mu nɔ sabatide koore ma sɔnɔn. <verse eid="REV 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9" />E naxa na sube magaaxuxi xungbe woli bɔxi ma, a nun a xa malekɛe. A tan nan findixi na bɔximase fori ra, naxan xili Ibulisa, xa na mu a ra Sentanɛ. A bara duniɲa birin madaxu.<verse eid="REV 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10" />Na tɛmui, n naxa xui itexi mɛ koore ma, a a falama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 12:10">«Yakɔsi, kisi tɛmui bara a li,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 12:10">muxu Marigi Ala sɛnbɛ nun a xa mangɛya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 12:10">nun a xa Mixi Sugandixi xa mangɛya bara fa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 12:10">barima naxan nu muxu ngaxakerenyie kalamuma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 12:10">muxu Marigi Ala ya i kɔɛ nun yanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 12:10">na bara bira.<verse eid="REV 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11" />Muxu ngaxakerenyie xutu sɔtɔxi a ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 12:11">Yɛxɛɛyɔrɛ wuli nun e xa seedeɲɔxɔya nan saabui ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 12:11">E mu kankan e xa simaya ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 12:11">e mu gaaxu faxɛ ya ra.<verse eid="REV 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12" />Na kui, koore nun naxee sabatixi naa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 12:12">e xa ɲɛlɛxin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 12:12">Kɔnɔ ɲaxankatɛ bara lu bɔxi nun baa ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 12:12">barima Ibulisa bara bira wo mabiri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 12:12">A xɔnɔxi barima a bara a kolon</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 12:12">a tɛmui gbegbe mu luxi a bɛ kɔrɛ.»<verse eid="REV 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13" />Sube magaaxuxi to a kolon, e bara a woli bɔxi ma, a naxa bira na ginɛ fɔxɔ ra, naxan na di xɛmɛ bari. <verse eid="REV 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14" />Kɔnɔ xaruma gabutenyi naxa lu na ginɛ bɛ, alako a xa tugan sigafe ra gbengberenyi ma, a luma balo ra dɛnnaxɛ waxati saxan nun a tagi bun ma. Mɛnni a nu bara makuya na bɔximase ra. <verse eid="REV 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15" />Kɔnɔ bɔximase naxa xure ramini a dɛ kui, a xa ginɛ madula. <verse eid="REV 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16" />Na tɛmui bɔxi naxa na xure ye min, sube magaaxuxi nu bara naxan namini a dɛ kui, alako a xa na ginɛ rakisi. <verse eid="REV 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17" />Sube magaaxuxi to xɔnɔ na ginɛ ma, a naxa siga na ginɛ bɔnsɔɛ dɔnxɔɛe gerede, naxee Ala xa sɛriyɛ rabatuma, e man la Isa xa seedeɲɔxɔya ra. <verse eid="REV 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18" />Na sube magaaxuxi naxa ti baa dɛ ra mɛyɛnyi fari.<verse eid="REV 12:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13" />
  <para style="s">Sube naxan texi ye xɔɔra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1" />Na dangi xanbi n naxa sube magaaxuxi nde to te ra ye xɔɔra, feri fu na a xunyi solofere ma, mangɛ katanyie dɔxɔxi na feri fu fari. Marasɔtɔ xilie fan nu sɛbɛxi a xunyie ma. <verse eid="REV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2" />Na sube magaaxuxi nu maniyaxi baratɛ nan na, a sanyie sɛnbɛ nu gbo, a dɛ nu luxi nɛ alɔ yɛtɛ dɛ. Na sube magaaxuxi naxa a sɛnbɛ, a xa nɔɛ, nun a xa kibanyi lu sube boore yi ra. <verse eid="REV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3" />Fi ɲaaxi to lu a xunyi keren ma, a naxa yalan. Na fi to mu a faxa, duniɲa naxa kaaba, e birin naxa bira a fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="REV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4" />Duniɲa mixie naxa tuubi sube magaaxuxi bɛ, barima a tan nan nu bara nɔɛ so sube boore yi ra. E man naxa tuubi sube boore bɛ, e nu a fala, «Nde maniya yi sube ra, nde nɔma a gerede?»<verse eid="REV 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5" />Na sube naxa nɔɛ sɔtɔ a xa yɛtɛ igboe masenyi nun marasɔtɔɛ falɛ ra. A naxa nɔɛ sɔtɔ, a xa wali kike tongo naani nun firin bun ma. <verse eid="REV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6" />A naxa Ala rasɔtɔ, a Ala xili kana, a Ala xa hɔrɔmɔlingira rasɔtɔ, a nun naxee sabatixi koore ma. <verse eid="REV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7" />A naxa nɔɛ sɔtɔ alako a xa sɛniyɛntɔɛe gere, a xa nɔ e ra. A naxa nɔɛ sɔtɔ bɔnsɔɛ, si, xui, nun ɲamanɛ birin xun ma. <verse eid="REV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8" />Duniɲa mixi birin fama tuubide a tan nan bɛ, naxee xili mu sɛbɛxi Yɛxɛɛyɔrɛ kɔn naxabaxi xa kisi buki kui kabi duniɲa fɔlɛ.<verse eid="REV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9" />Tuli na naxan bɛ, a xa a tuli mati yi masenyi ra. <verse eid="REV 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10" />Konyiya ragirixi mixi naxan ma, a sigama nɛ konyiya kui. Santidɛgɛma faxɛ ragirixi mixi naxan ma, na kanyi fan faxama nɛ santidɛgɛma ra. Sɛniyɛntɔɛe xa tunnabɛxi nun danxaniya kolonma na nan kui.<verse eid="REV 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11" />Na dangi xanbi n man naxa sube magaaxuxi gbɛtɛ to a tefe bɔxi bun ma, feri firin nu na a bɛ alɔ yɛxɛɛ, a nu wɔyɛnma alɔ sube magaaxuxi. <verse eid="REV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12" />A nu na sube magaaxuxi singe sɛnbɛ nan nawalife na ya xɔri, a a niya duniɲa mixi birin xa tuubi na sube magaaxuxi singe bɛ, naxan xa fi ɲaaxi nu bara yalan. <verse eid="REV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13" />A nu luma kaabanakoe belebele raba ra, han a tɛ ragoro bɔxi ma kelife koore ma mixie ya xɔri. <verse eid="REV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14" />A to na sɛnbɛ sɔtɔ, a naxa duniɲa mixie madaxu a xa kaabanakoe ra na sube magaaxuxi singe ya xɔri. A naxa a fala duniɲa mixie bɛ e xa kuye yailan naxan maniya na sube magaaxuxi singe ra, naxan nu bara maxɔnɔ santidɛgɛma ra, kɔnɔ a mu faxa. <verse eid="REV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15" />E to na kuye yailan, a naxa nɔɛ sɔtɔ a xa a niya na kuye xa wɔyɛn, mixi birin xa faxa naxan mu tuubima na kuye bɛ. <verse eid="REV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16" />A naxa yaamari fi, dimɛdie nun forie, bannae nun setaree, lasirie nun konyie, tɔnxuma xa sa e birin yirefanyi bɛlɛxɛ ma, xa na mu e tigi ma, <verse eid="REV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17" />alako mixi matɔnxumataree naxa sare so, e naxa sare mati. Na tɔnxuma findixi sube xili nan na, xa na mu a ra yi kɔnti nan findixi xili ra. <verse eid="REV 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18" />Lɔnni na naxan bɛ, a xa na kɔnti kolon, barima a adamadi xa fe masenma. Na kɔnti naxan findixi xili ra a findixi kɛmɛ senni, tongo senni nun senni nan na.<verse eid="REV 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14" />
  <para style="s">Yɛxɛɛyɔrɛ nun a xa mixi rakisixie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1" />N to n ya rage, n naxa Yɛxɛɛyɔrɛ to a tixi Siyoni geya fari. Mixi wulu kɛmɛ wulu tongo naani nun naani nu na a sɛɛti ma, Yɛxɛɛyɔrɛ xili nun a Baba xili sɛbɛxi e tigie ma. <verse eid="REV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2" />N naxa xui nde mɛ koore ma, alɔ xure xungbe, xa na mu a ra alɔ galanyi. A nu luxi nɛ alɔ mixie nan nu kɔra bɔnbɔfe. <verse eid="REV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3" />E nu na bɛɛti nɛɛnɛ bafe mangɛ kibanyi ya i, a nun na nimase naani nun na forie. Mixi yo mu nu nɔma na bɛɛti matinkande, fo na duniɲa mixi wulu kɛmɛ wulu tongo naani nun naani naxee xun nu bara sara. <verse eid="REV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4" />E mu nu yɛnɛ rabaxi ginɛ ra, e nu sɛniyɛn. E birama na Yɛxɛɛyɔrɛ fɔxɔ ra yire birin. E xun nu bara sara mixie tagi, alako e xa findi Ala gbe nun Yɛxɛɛyɔrɛ gbe ra, alɔ sɛrɛxɛ singe naxan bama Ala bɛ xɛ xaba tɛmui. <verse eid="REV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5" />E dɛ mu nu wule falaxi, marakɔrɔsi yo mu nu e ma.<verse eid="REV 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6" />N naxa malekɛ gbɛtɛ to a ɲɛrɛ ra koore ma. Xibaaru fanyi nu na a yi ra duniɲa mixie bɛ, si, bɔnsɔɛ, xui, nun ɲamanɛ birin bɛ abadan. <verse eid="REV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7" />A naxa a fala a xui itexi ra, «Wo xa gaaxu Ala ya ra, wo xa a matɔxɔ, barima a xa kiiti waxati bara a li. Wo xa wo igoro a bɛ, naxan koore, bɔxi, baa, nun dulonyie daaxi.»<verse eid="REV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8" />Malekɛ firin nde nu biraxi a fɔxɔ ra, a nu fa a fala, «Babilɔn belebele bara bira. Babilɔn bara bira, naxan ɲamanɛe rasiisixi a xa fe ɲaaxie ra.»<verse eid="REV 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9" />Malekɛ saxan nde nu biraxi e fɔxɔ ra, a nu fa a fala a xui itexi ra, «Xa mixi nde a igoroma na sube bɛ, xa na mu a ra na kuye bɛ naxan yailanxi a misaali ra, a fa sa li tɔnxuma na a tigi ma, xa na mu a bɛlɛxɛ ma, <verse eid="REV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10" />na kanyi fan Ala xa xɔnɛ kolonma nɛ, a fa lu alɔ siisila naxan beere xɔrɔxɔɛ minxi. A fama tɔɔrɔde tɛ nun soda xɔɔra, malekɛ sɛniyɛnxie nun Yɛxɛɛyɔrɛ ya xɔri. <verse eid="REV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11" />Tuuri naxan tema na tɛ xɔɔra a mu ɲɔnma abadan. Na mixie, naxee e igoroma na sube bɛ, xa na mu a ra na kuye bɛ naxan yailanxi a misaali ra, a fa sa li na sube xili tɔnxuma saxi e ma, na kanyie mu malabui sɔtɔma kɔɛ nun yanyi. <verse eid="REV 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12" />Sɛniyɛntɔɛ xa tunnabɛxi nan na ki, naxee Ala xa sɛriyɛ rabatuma, naxee danxaniyaxi Isa ma.»<verse eid="REV 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13" />N naxa xui nde mɛ koore ma a falafe ra, «I xa a sɛbɛ a sɛɛwɛ na mixie bɛ, naxee faxama Ala xa fe kui yakɔsi han duniɲa raɲɔnyi.» Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi naxa a masen, «Iyo, nɔndi na a ra. E lan e xa e malabu e xa wali xɔrɔxɔɛ ma, e xa na wali sare sɔtɔ.»<verse eid="REV 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14" />N naxa nuxui fiixɛ to. Daali nde nu magoroxi a fari, naxan maniya adamadi ra. Mangɛ katanyi xɛɛma daaxi nu saxi a xun ma, waratɛ xɛɲɛnxi nu na a bɛlɛxɛ. <verse eid="REV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15" />Malekɛ gbɛtɛ naxa mini hɔrɔmɔlingira kui, a a fala a bɛ a xui itexi ra, «I xa waratɛ rawali, xɛ xaba, barima na waxati bara a li, duniɲa xɛ xa xaba. <verse eid="REV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16" />Naxan nu magoroxi nuxui fari, a naxa waratɛ rawali duniɲa ma, duniɲa xɛ naxa xaba.»<verse eid="REV 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17" />Malekɛ gbɛtɛ naxa mini koore hɔrɔmɔlingira kui, waratɛ xɛɲɛnxi nu na a bɛlɛxɛ. <verse eid="REV 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18" />Malekɛ gbɛtɛ, naxan nu tɛ yamarima, a naxa keli sɛrɛxɛbade yire, a a fala a xui itexi ra waratɛ xɛɲɛnxi kanyi bɛ, «Waratɛ xɛɲɛnxi rawali, wɛni bogie xaba duniɲa, barima e bara mɔ.» <verse eid="REV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19" />Na malekɛ naxa waratɛ rawali, a fa duniɲa wɛni bogi birin ba, a e sa a sase kui Ala xa xɔnɛ e maboronma dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="REV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20" />Na wali naxa raba taa fari ma. Mixi wuli naxa na se sase rafe, a fili a ma han na wuli naxa ikuya kilo kɛmɛ saxan na, a xa tilinyi fan soe dɛ suxuma.<verse eid="REV 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15" />
  <para style="s">Malekɛ solofere nun gbaloe dɔnxɔɛe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1" />Na dangi xanbi, n man naxa tɔnxuma xungbe to naxan bara n dɛ ixara. Malekɛ solofere naxa mini gbaloe dɔnxɔɛ solofere ra, Ala xa xɔnɛ kamalima naxee ra. <verse eid="REV 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2" />N naxa baa nde to, a luxi alɔ diyaman, a sunbuxi tɛ ra. Mixi naxee nu bara nɔ na sube ra, a nun na kuye naxan yailanxi a misaali ra, a nun a xili xa kɔnti ra, e nu tixi baa fari, Ala xa kɔrae nu na e bɛlɛxɛ. <verse eid="REV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3" />E nu Ala xa konyi Munsa xa bɛɛti nan bama, a nun Yɛxɛɛyɔrɛ xa bɛɛti, a falafe ra, «Muxu Marigi Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanyi, i xa walie sɛnbɛ gbo! E makaaba! Duniɲa Mangɛ, i xa kira nɔndi na a ra, a man tinxin. <verse eid="REV 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4" />Marigi, nde mu gaaxuma i ya ra? Nde mu i xili matɔxɔma? I keren peti nan sɛniyɛn. Ɲamanɛ birin fama nɛ e magorode i bɛ, barima i bara i xa tinxinyi makɛnɛn.»<verse eid="REV 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5" />Na to dangi, n naxa Ala xa hɔrɔmɔlingira rabixi to koore ma, saatɛ kankira na naxan kui. <verse eid="REV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6" />Malekɛ solofere, tɔɔrɛ dɔnxɔɛ solofere nu na naxee yi ra, e naxa mini hɔrɔmɔlingira kui, sɛrɛxɛdubɛ dugi fiixɛ mayanbaxie ragoroxi e ma, bɛlɛti xɛɛma daaxi balanxi e kanke ma. <verse eid="REV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7" />Nimase keren na nimase naani ya ma, a naxa tɔnbili xɛɛma daaxi solofere so na malekɛ solofere yi ra. Na tɔnbilie nu rafexi Ala xa xɔnɛ nan na, Ala naxan ɲiɲɛ a ra abadan. <verse eid="REV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8" />Tuuri naxa hɔrɔmɔlingira rafe Ala xa nɔrɛ nun a sɛnbɛ xa fe ra. Mixi yo mu nu nɔma sode hɔrɔmɔlingira kui, fo tɔɔrɛ solofere xa wali xa kamali naxee nu na malekɛ soloferee yi ra.<verse eid="REV 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16" />
  <para style="s">Tɔnbili solofere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1" />N naxa xui xungbe nde mɛ, naxan kelixi hɔrɔmɔlingira kui, a a falama malekɛe bɛ, «Wo siga, wo xa Ala xa xɔnɛ tɔnbili soloferee ifili duniɲa ma.» <verse eid="REV 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2" />Malekɛ singe naxa siga, a sa a xa tɔnbili ifili duniɲa ma. Na kui, fi ɲaaxi naxa mini mixie ma, na sube xa tɔnxuma nu saxi naxee ma, naxee nu tuubima kuye bɛ naxan yailanxi a misaali ra.<verse eid="REV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3" />Malekɛ firin nde naxa a xa tɔnbili ifili baa ma. Baa naxa lu alɔ mixi faxaxi wuli. Nimase birin naxa faxa, naxee nu na baa ma.<verse eid="REV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4" />Malekɛ saxan nde naxa a xa tɔnbili ifili xuree nun dulonyie ma. E fan naxa findi wuli ra. <verse eid="REV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5" />N naxa malekɛ xui mɛ, naxan nu ye yamarima. A naxa a fala, «I tan naxan na to, i tan naxan na xoro, i tan naxan sɛniyɛn, i bara kiiti tinxinxi sa, <verse eid="REV 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6" />barima e nu bara sɛniyɛntɔɛe nun namiɲɔnmɛe wuli ramini. I fan bara wuli so e yi ra, e naxan minma. A lanxi na ki nɛ.» <verse eid="REV 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7" />N naxa sɛrɛxɛbade fan xui mɛ. A naxa a fala, «Iyo, Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanyi, i xa kiiti birin tinxin, e findixi nɔndi nan na.»<verse eid="REV 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8" />Malekɛ naani nde naxa a xa tɔnbili ifili soge ma. Soge naxa yaamari sɔtɔ a xa adamadie gan a tɛ ra. <verse eid="REV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9" />Wuyenyi ɲaaxi naxa mixie gan. E naxa Ala xili rasɔtɔ, naxan na tɔɔrɛ birin nasanbaxi. E mu tuubi, e tondi Ala matɔxɔde.<verse eid="REV 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10" />Malekɛ suuli nde naxa a xa tɔnbili ifili na sube xa kibanyi ma. A xa mangɛya naxa lu dimi kui, mixie naxa e nɛnyie xin ɲaxankatɛ ma, <verse eid="REV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11" />e fa Ala xili rasɔtɔ, naxan na koore ma, e xa tɔɔrɛ nun e xa fie xa fe ra. E tondi gbilende e xa wali kobie fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="REV 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12" />Malekɛ senni nde naxa a xa tɔnbili ifili Efirati xure xungbe ma. Na xure naxa xara, alako a xa findi kira ra mangɛe bɛ, naxee fama kelife sogetede. <verse eid="REV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13" />N naxa ɲinnɛ sɛniyɛntare saxan to mini ra na sube magaaxuxi dɛ kui, na sube boore dɛ kui, a nun na namiɲɔnmɛ wule falɛ dɛ kui. Na ɲinnɛe nu maniyaxi xuuɲɛe nan na. <verse eid="REV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14" />Sentanɛ xa ɲinnɛe nan nu e ra, naxee tɔnxumae rabama, e man sigama duniɲa mangɛe maxilide, alako e xa e malan, e xa gere so Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanyi xa lɔxɔɛ xungbe ma. <verse eid="REV 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15" />«Wo bara a to, n fama tɛrɛnna nan na, alɔ muɲɛti a gbe wali rabama ki naxɛ. Sɛɛwɛ na mixi bɛ naxan mu xima, naxan mu a xa dugi bama. Na kanyi naxa lu a mageli ra, alako a naxa yaagi.» <verse eid="REV 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16" />Ɲinnɛe naxa duniɲa mangɛe malan yire nde naxan xili falama Eburu xui ra «Aramagedon.»<verse eid="REV 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17" />Malekɛ solofere nde naxa a xa tɔnbili ifili kuye ma. Xui xungbe nde naxa mini hɔrɔmɔlingira kui Ala xa kibanyi mabiri, a a masen, «A bara ɲɔn.» <verse eid="REV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18" />Galanyi naxa bula, xuie naxa mini, seyamakɔnyie naxa mini, bɔxi naxa sɛrɛn, naxan maniyɛ mu nu raba sinden kafi duniɲa fɔlɛ. <verse eid="REV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19" />Na taa xungbe naxa kana alɔ se naxan giraxi dɔxɔ saxan. Duniɲa taae birin naxa bira. Ala naxa ratu Babilɔn taa gbe ma, a wɛni tɔnbili fi a ma a xa Ala xa xɔnɛ mankanɛ min. <verse eid="REV 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20" />Surie nun geyae naxa lɔɛ. <verse eid="REV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21" />Balabalanyi belebelee naxa keli koore ma, e bira mixie ma. A xɔri keren binya kilo tongo saxan nun naani ɲɔndɔn. Mixie naxa Ala xili rasɔtɔ na balabalanyi xa fe ra, barima na tɔɔrɛ nu gbo a gbe ra.<verse eid="REV 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17" />
  <para style="s">Babilɔn xa kanɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1" />Na dangi xanbi, malekɛ keren naxan nu na na malekɛ tɔnbili kanyi solofere ya ma, a naxa a fala n bɛ, «Fa be, alako n xa langoe xungbe xa kiiti masen i bɛ, na langoe naxan dɔxɔxi xure xungbee dɛ ra.» <verse eid="REV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2" />Duniɲa mangɛe nun na langoe ginɛ naxa fe kobi raba. E xa mixie fan naxa bira fe ɲaaxie fɔxɔ ra han e naxa lu alɔ siisilae.<verse eid="REV 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3" />Na malekɛ naxa laamatunyi nde masen n bɛ. N naxa ginɛ nde to gbengberenyi ma, a dɔxɔxi sube gbeeli fari, marasɔtɔ xilie nu sɛbɛxi naxan ma. Xunyi solofere nu na a ma, feri fu tixi a xun ma. <verse eid="REV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4" />Na ginɛ nu maxirixi donma gbeeli tofanyi nan na, kɔnmagore, bɛlɛxɛrasoe, nun xurundɛ tofanyie nu na a yi ra naxee yailanxi xɛɛma nun gɛmɛ tofanyie ra. Pɔɔti xɛɛma daaxi suxuxi a yi ra, fe xɔnxi sɛniyɛntaree nu na a kui, naxee misaalixi a xa wali ɲaaxi ra. <verse eid="REV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5" />Xili nde sɛbɛxi a tigi ma gundo daaxi: «Babilɔn xungbe, yɛnɛlae nun fe ɲaaxie nga.» <verse eid="REV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6" />N naxa na ginɛ to, a siisixi sɛniyɛntɔɛe wuli ra, naxee nu findixi Isa xa seedee ra. N to a to, n dɛ naxa ixara ki fanyi.<verse eid="REV 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7" />Na malekɛ naxa a fala n bɛ, «Munfe ra i dɛ ixaraxi? N fama nɛ yi gundo tagi rabade i bɛ, yi ginɛ xa fe ra nun yi sube xunyi solofere nun feri fu kanyi xa fe ra a dɔxɔxi naxan fari. <verse eid="REV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8" />I sube naxan to, a nu na na, kɔnɔ a mu na yakɔsi. A fama nɛ tede yili tilinxi kui, a fa bɔnɔ. Adamadi naxee xili mu sɛbɛxi kisi buki kui, kabi duniɲa fɔlɛ, e kaabama nɛ yi sube xa fe ra, barima singe a nu na, yakɔsi a mu na, kɔnɔ tɛmui naxan sa fama, a man minima nɛ.»<verse eid="REV 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9" />Xaxilima nɔma yi fahaamude: Na xunyi solofere misaalixi geya solofere nan na, ginɛ dɔxɔxi naxee fari. <verse eid="REV 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10" />Nee man misaalixi mangɛ solofere nan na. Suuli bara bira, keren na na, boore mu nu fa sinden. A na fa, a buma nɛ dondoronti. <verse eid="REV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11" />Sube naxan nu na na, kɔnɔ a mu na yakɔsi, na misaalixi mangɛ solomasaxan nde nan na. A fan na na na mangɛ solofere nan ya ma naxan fama bɔnɔde.<verse eid="REV 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12" />Na feri fu i naxee toxi, nee fan misaalixi mangɛ fu nan na, naxee mu nu mangɛya sɔtɔ sinden. E tan nun na sube, e fama mangɛ nɔɛ nan sɔtɔde waxati keren bun ma. <verse eid="REV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13" />E waxɔnfe birin lan. E e xa sɛnbɛ nun e xa mangɛya ragbilenma nɛ na sube ma. <verse eid="REV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14" />E Yɛxɛɛyɔrɛ gerema nɛ, kɔnɔ Yɛxɛɛyɔrɛ nan geenima, barima a tan nan findixi marigie Marigi ra, mangɛe xa Mangɛ. A xa mixi sugandixie, a xa danxaniyatɔɛe na a sɛɛti ma. <verse eid="REV 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15" />A naxa a fala n bɛ, «Na xuree i naxee toxi, na langoe ginɛ dɔxɔxi xure naxee dɛ ra, e misaalixi ɲamanɛe, bɔnsɔɛe, sie, nun xuie nan na. <verse eid="REV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16" />Na feri fu nun na sube, i naxee toxi, e na langoe ginɛ xɔnma nɛ. E fama nɛ se birin bade a yi ra, e fa a ti a mageli ra, e a sube don, e a dɔnxɔɛ woli tɛ xɔɔra, <verse eid="REV 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17" />barima Ala nan a ragirixi e xa a waxɔnfe raba. E xa e xa mangɛya ragbilen na sube ma, han Ala xa masenyi kamalima tɛmui naxɛ. <verse eid="REV 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18" />Na ginɛ i naxan toxi, a misaalixi duniɲa mangɛe xa mangataa xungbe nan na.»<verse eid="REV 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18" />
  <para style="s">Babilɔn birafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1" />Na dangi xanbi, n naxa malekɛ gbɛtɛ to goro ra keli koore ma. Nɔɛ xungbe nu na a yi, a xa nɔrɛ naxa duniɲa iyalan. <verse eid="REV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2" />A naxa a fala a xui itexi ra, «Babilɔn xungbe bara bira. Babilɔn bara bira, a bara findi ɲinnɛe xɔnyi ra, ɲinnɛ sɛniyɛntaree nun xɔni raharamuxie luma dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="REV 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3" />A kanaxi nɛ barima si birin bara bira a xa fe ɲaaxie fɔxɔ ra. Duniɲa mangɛe bara lu a sɛɛti ma a xa wali kobi kui. Duniɲa yulɛe fan bara banna a waxɔnfe saabui ra. E birin luxi nɛ alɔ siisilae.»<verse eid="REV 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4" />N naxa xui gbɛtɛ mɛ keli koore ma a falafe ra, «N ma ɲama, wo xa mini a ya ma, alako wo fan naxa lu a xa yunubie kui, wo xa a xa tɔɔrɛ fan sɔtɔ. <verse eid="REV 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5" />A xa yunubie bara gbo a gbegbe ra. Ala bara ratu a xa tinxintareya birin ma. <verse eid="REV 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6" />Wo xa a xa wali sare ragbilen a ma dɔxɔ firin. A naxan nabaxi wo ra, wo xa na raba a tan fan na dɔxɔ firin. <verse eid="REV 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7" />A waxɔnfe xun to nu masaxi tɛmui birin, wo fan xa a xa tɔɔrɛ xun masa na ki, a xa sunnun, barima a a fala nɛ a bɔɲɛ kui, ‹Mangɛ ginɛ nan n na. Kaaɲɛ ginɛ mu na n na, n mu luma sunnunyi kui abadan.› <verse eid="REV 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8" />Na masenyi xa fe ra, a fama yi gbaloe tode lɔxɔɛ keren: faxɛ, sunnunyi, nun kaamɛ. A ganma nɛ tɛ ra, barima Marigi Ala Sɛnbɛma nan a makiitixi.»<verse eid="REV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9" />Duniɲa mangɛ birin naxee bara bira a xa fe ɲaaxie nun a waxɔnfee fɔxɔ ra, e fama nɛ wade. E na a to a xa taa na ganfe, e sunnunma nɛ. <verse eid="REV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10" />E lu yire makuye barima e gaaxuxi a xa tɔɔrɛ ya ra. E nu fa a fala, «Ɲaxankatɛ na Babilɔn bɛ. Ɲaxankatɛ na na taa xungbe sɛnbɛma bɛ. A bara makiiti lɛɛri keren bun ma.»<verse eid="REV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11" />Duniɲa yulɛe wama nɛ a xa fe ra, e sunnunma nɛ, barima mixi mu na naxan e xa kotee sarama sɔnɔn, <verse eid="REV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12" />kote naxan findixi xɛɛma ra, gbeti, gɛmɛ tofanyie, dugi gɛsɛ daaxi, dugi gbeeli, wuri fanyi, sili ɲinyi masolixi, wuri fanyi masolixi, yɔxui, wure, gɛmɛ xɔrɔxɔɛ, <verse eid="REV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13" />donse ɲɔxunmɛ, surayi mɔɔli birin, labundɛ, wɛni, ture, farin fanyi, ningee, yɛxɛɛe, soee, sɔɔri ragisee, nun konyie. <verse eid="REV 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14" />«I waxɔnfe birin bara makuya i ra, na se fanyie bara lɔɛ i ma. I mu nee sɔtɔma sɔnɔn.» <verse eid="REV 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15" />Yulɛ naxee bannaxi a saabui ra, e fan luma nɛ yire makuye, barima e gaaxuxi a xa tɔɔrɛ ya ra. E wama nɛ, e lu sunnunyi kui. <verse eid="REV 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16" />E nu a fala, «Ɲaxankatɛ na na taa xungbe bɛ, ɲaxankatɛ na a bɛ, naxan nu wama dugi fiixɛ, dugi gbeeli, xɛɛma, nun gɛmɛ tofanyie xɔn.»<verse eid="REV 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17" />A xa naafuli birin bara kana na waxati kerenyi kui. Kunkui raɲɛrɛe nun mixi naxan birin kunkui wali nde rabama, e luma nɛ yire makuye, <verse eid="REV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18" />e fa a fala e xui itexi ra na taa xungbe ganxi ya ra, «Yi taa, a maniyɛ mu na.» <verse eid="REV 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19" />E fama nɛ xube masode e xunyi ma, e wa, e lu sunnunyi kui, e a fala, «Ɲaxankatɛ na na taa xungbe bɛ, ɲaxankatɛ na na taa bɛ kunkui kanyie bannaxi dɛnnaxɛ. Na taa bara findi gbengberenyi ra na waxati kerenyi kui.»<verse eid="REV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20" />«Naxee na koore, wo xa ɲɛlɛxin na taa xa ɲaxankatɛ xa fe ra. Sɛniyɛntɔɛe, Ala xa xɛɛrae, nun namiɲɔnmɛe, wo tan xa ɲɛlɛxin, barima Ala bara wo gbeɲɔxɔ.» <verse eid="REV 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21" />Na tɛmui malekɛ sɛnbɛma nde naxa gɛmɛ xungbe tongo naxan nu luxi alɔ se luxutase, a naxa a woli baa ma a falafe ra, «Babilɔn taa xungbe birama nɛ a ɲaaxi ra alɔ yi gɛmɛ. Mixi mu a toma sɔnɔn.»<verse eid="REV 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22" />«I xa sigie mu mɛma sɔnɔn, naxee sama kɔra, xule, nun sara xui ra. Wali xui mu minima i xɔnyi sɔnɔn, maale din xui fan mu luma i xɔnyi sɔnɔn. <verse eid="REV 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23" />Lanpui xa naiyalanyi mu toma i xɔnyi sɔnɔn. Futi xirimae xa ɲɛlɛxin xui mu mɛma i xɔnyi sɔnɔn, barima i xa yulɛe nu bara findi mixi xungbee ra duniɲa, i bara si birin natantan i xa fe ɲaaxie saabui ra. <verse eid="REV 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24" />Namiɲɔnmɛe nun sɛniyɛntɔɛe wuli bara mini i xɔnyi, a nun naxee kɔn bara raxaba bɔxi ma.»<verse eid="REV 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19" />
  <para style="s">Ala xa tantui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1" />Na to dangi, n naxa ɲama xungbe xui mɛ koore ma a fala ra, «Ala tantu. Kisi, xunnakeli, nun sɛnbɛ na muxu Marigi Ala bɛ, <verse eid="REV 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2" />barima a xa kiiti tinxin, a findixi nɔndi nan na. A bara langoe ginɛ makiiti, naxan nu bara duniɲa ratantan a xa fe ɲaaxie ra. Ala bara a xa konyie wuli gbeɲɔxɔ a ma.»<verse eid="REV 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3" />Ɲama man naxa a fala a firin nde, «Ala tantu. Babilɔn tuuri tema nɛ abadan.»<verse eid="REV 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4" />Na fori mɔxɔɲɛn nun naani, nun na nimase naani naxa e felen bɔxi, e Ala batu naxan nu magoroxi kibanyi kui, a falafe ra, «Amina, Ala tantu.»<verse eid="REV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5" />Xui nde naxa mini kibanyi, a falafe ra, «Ala xa konyie, wo xa won Marigi Ala matɔxɔ, wo tan naxee gaaxu a ya ra, wo tan dimɛe nun forie.»<verse eid="REV 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6" />N naxa ɲama xungbe xui mɛ naxan sɛnbɛ gbo alɔ xure wundu xui, xa na mu a ra galanyi xui. E naxa a fala, «Ala tantu, barima Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanyi, won Marigi Ala bara so a xa mangɛya kui. <verse eid="REV 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7" />Won xa sɛɛwa, won xa ɲɛlɛxin, won xa a binya, barima Yɛxɛɛyɔrɛ xa futi xiri tɛmui bara a li. A naxan dɔxɔma, a bara gɛ a yɛtɛ yailande. <verse eid="REV 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8" />A naxan dɔxɔma a bara dugi fiixɛ tofanyi ragoro a ma, naxan misaalixi sɛniyɛntɔɛe xa kɛwali tinxinxie ra.»<verse eid="REV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9" />Malekɛ naxa a fala n bɛ, «I xa a sɛbɛ, ‹Ɲɛlɛxinyi na mixie bɛ naxee maxilixi Yɛxɛɛyɔrɛ xa futi xiri malanyi.›» A naxa a fala n bɛ, «Ala xa nɔndi nan na ki.» <verse eid="REV 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10" />N naxa n xinbi sin a bun ma n xa a batu, kɔnɔ a naxa a fala n bɛ, «Ade, i naxa na raba. N fan findixi Ala xa konyi nan na alɔ i tan nun i ngaxakerenyi naxee bara la Isa xa seedeɲɔxɔya ra. I xa Ala nan batu. Isa xa seedeɲɔxɔya findixi namiɲɔnmɛ xa masenyi xɔri nan na.»<verse eid="REV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11" />Na dangi xanbi n naxa koore to rabi ra, soe fiixɛ tixi na, a ragima xili Dugutɛgɛ nun Nɔndi falɛ. A gere soma tinxinyi nan na, a kiiti sa tinxinyi kui. <verse eid="REV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12" />A yae nu luxi nɛ alɔ tɛ, mangɛ katanyi naxan yailanxi gɛmɛ tofanyi ra nu dusuxi a xun na. A xili sɛbɛxi a ma, xili mixi yo mu naxan kolon bafe a tan na. <verse eid="REV 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13" />A xa dugi bundaxi wuli ra. A xili nɛ Ala xa Masenyi. <verse eid="REV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14" />Koore sɔɔri gali nu biraxi a fɔxɔ ra e xa soe fiixɛe fari, dugi fiixɛ tofanyie fan nagoroxi e ma. <verse eid="REV 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15" />Santidɛgɛma xɛɲɛnxi nu minixi a dɛ i, alako a xa ɲamanɛe gere, a xa e yamari sawuri sɛnbɛma ra, Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanyi xa xɔnɛ xa kamali. <verse eid="REV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16" />A sɛbɛxi a xa dugi xungbe ma, a nun a tabe ma, «Mangɛe xa Mangɛ, marigie Marigi.»<verse eid="REV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17" />N naxa malekɛ to, a tixi soge fari. A naxa a fala a xui itexi ra xɔni birin bɛ naxee nu na koore ma, «Wo fa Ala xa xunnakeli yire, <verse eid="REV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18" />wo xa mangɛe sube don, a nun sɔɔri mangɛe sube, sɛnbɛmae sube, soee sube, soe ragie sube, lasiri nun konyie sube, dimɛe nun forie sube.»<verse eid="REV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19" />N naxa na sube to, a nun duniɲa mangɛe nun e xa sɔɔrie. E birin nu malanxi alako e xa na soe fiixɛ ragima nun a xa sɔɔri gali gere.<verse eid="REV 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20" />Soe fiixɛ ragima naxa na sube ɲaaxi suxu, a nun na namiɲɔnmɛ wule falɛ, naxan nu bara mixie madaxu tɔnxumae ra, sube xa tɔnxuma nu saxi mixi naxee ma, a nun naxee nu bara na sube xa kuye batu. Na firinyie birin naxa woli tɛ nun soda xɔɔra. <verse eid="REV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21" />Santidɛgɛma naxan nu minima soe fiixɛ ragima dɛ kui, a naxa booree faxa, xɔnie fa e sube don.<verse eid="REV 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20" />
  <para style="s">Sentanɛ raɲɔnyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1" />Na dangi xanbi, n naxa malekɛ to goro ra kelife koore ma, yili tilinxi naadɛ saabi nun yɔlɔnxɔnyi belebele nu na a yi ra. <verse eid="REV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2" />A naxa na sube magaaxuxi suxu, na bɔximase fori, naxan findixi Ibulisa ra, na nan na ki Sentanɛ. A naxa a xiri, a xa lu na ki ɲɛ wulu keren bun ma. <verse eid="REV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3" />A naxa a woli yili tilinxi kui, a naadɛ balan, a tɔnxuma sa naadɛ ma, alako a naxa mini sie madaxude han na ɲɛ wulu keren xa kamali. Na xanbi a lanma a xa fulun waxati dunkedi bun ma.<verse eid="REV 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4" />N naxa kibanyi ndee to. Mixi naxee magoroxi e kui, nee nu bara yaamari sɔtɔ e xa kiiti sa. N naxa mixie to naxee xunyie nu bara ba e dɛ i Isa xa seedeɲɔxɔya nun Ala xa masenyi xa fe ra. N man naxa mixie to naxee mu nu tuubi na sube nun a xa kuye bɛ, na sube xili mu nu sɛbɛxi e tigi ma, xa na mu a ra e bɛlɛxɛ ma. E nu bara keli faxɛ ma, e ɲiɲɛ, e yaamari raba Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi sɛɛti ma ɲɛ wulu keren bun ma. <verse eid="REV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5" />Boore mixi faxaxie mu nu kelixi faxɛ ma sinden, fo na ɲɛ wulu keren xa kamali. Marakeli singe nan na ki. <verse eid="REV 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6" />Ɲɛlɛxinyi nun sɛniyɛnyi na mixie bɛ naxee bara lu na marakeli singe kui. Saya firin nde mu nɔma e lide sɔnɔn. E findima nɛ Ala nun Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi xa sɛrɛxɛdubɛe ra, e fa yaamari ti a sɛɛti ma ɲɛ wulu keren bun ma.<verse eid="REV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7" />Na ɲɛ wulu keren na kamali tɛmui naxɛ, Sentanɛ minima nɛ a xa geeli kui, <verse eid="REV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8" />a siga duniɲa birin sie madaxude, alɔ Gogo nun Magogo, a e malan gere xili ma. E xasabi luma nɛ alɔ mɛyɛnyi naxan na baa dɛ ra.<verse eid="REV 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9" />Sie kelima nɛ duniɲa yire birin, e fa Ala xa ɲama rabilin a xa taa xanuxi kui. Kɔnɔ na tɛmui tɛ goroma nɛ kelife koore ma, a fa e sɔntɔ. <verse eid="REV 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10" />Ibulisa naxan nu sie madaxuma, a tan bara woli tɛ nun soda xɔɔra, na sube nun na namiɲɔnmɛ wule falɛ na dɛnnaxɛ. E ɲaxankatama nɛ naa kɔɛ nun yanyi ra abadan.<verse eid="REV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11" />Na dangi xanbi, n naxa kibanyi xungbe fiixɛ to, Ala magoroxi a kui. Bɔxi nun koore naxa e gi a ya ra, e lɔɛ. <verse eid="REV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12" />N naxa mixi faxaxie to, forie nun dimɛe, e birin tixi kibanyi ya i. Bukie naxa rabi, boore buki fan naxa rabi naxan findixi kisi buki ra. Mixi faxaxie naxa makiiti e kɛwali ra naxan nu sɛbɛxi na bukie kui. <verse eid="REV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13" />Mixi faxaxie naxee nu na baa ma, nee naxa keli. Mixi faxaxie naxee nu na aligiyama, nee fan naxa keli, e birin naxa makiiti e kɛwali ma. <verse eid="REV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14" />Faxɛ nun aligiyama naxa woli tɛ xɔɔra, naxan findixi faxɛ firin nde ra. <verse eid="REV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15" />Mixi naxan birin xili mu nu sɛbɛxi kisi buki kui, e naxa woli tɛ xɔɔra.<verse eid="REV 20:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21" />
  <para style="s">Koore nɛɛnɛ nun bɔxi nɛɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1" />N naxa koore nun bɔxi nɛɛnɛ to, barima koore nun bɔxi singe nu bara lɔɛ, baa fan mu nu na sɔnɔn. <verse eid="REV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2" />N naxa taa sɛniyɛnxi to, Darisalamu nɛɛnɛ, naxan nu na gorofe keli koore ma Ala sɛɛti ma. A nu rafalaxi a fanyi ra alɔ ginɛ naxan sigama a xa mɔri ralande a xa futi xiri lɔxɔɛ. <verse eid="REV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3" />N naxa xui sɛnbɛma nde mɛ kelife kibanyi yire, a falafe ra, «Ala xa hɔrɔmɔlingira nan ya naxan tixi adamadie ya ma. Ala sabatima nɛ adamadie tagi, e findi a xa ɲama ra, a fan findi e Marigi Ala ra, a lu e tagi. <verse eid="REV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4" />A e yaye birin bama nɛ. Faxɛ, sunnunyi, wa xui, nun tɔɔrɛ mu luma naa sɔnɔn, barima na fe mɔɔli naxee nu na singe ra, nee birin bara ɲɔn.»<verse eid="REV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5" />Naxan magoroxi kibanyi kui a naxa a fala, «Yakɔsi, n bara fe birin masara.» A man naxa a fala, «A sɛbɛ, barima masenyi na a ra naxan findixi nɔndi ra, a mu kanama abadan.» <verse eid="REV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6" />A naxa a fala n bɛ, «A bara ɲɔn. N tan nan na fe singe nun fe dɔnxɔɛ ra, a fɔlɛ nun a raɲɔnyi. Ye xɔli na naxan ma, n kisi ye fima nɛ a ma, a mu sarama. Na ye misaalixi kisi nan na. <verse eid="REV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7" />Mixi naxan geenima, a kɛ nan na ki. N bara findi a Marigi Ala ra, a fan bara findi n ma di ra. <verse eid="REV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8" />Kɔnɔ mixi gaaxuxie, danxaniyataree, mixi ɲaaxie, faxɛtie, yɛnɛlae, mandurulae, kuye batuie, wule falɛe, e birin luma nɛ tɛ nun soda xɔɔra. Na findima faxɛ firin nde nan na.»<verse eid="REV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9" />Malekɛ nde naxan nu na na malekɛ solofere ya ma, tɔnbili solofere nu na naxee yi ra, mankanɛ solofere saxi e kui, a naxa fa n yire, a a fala n bɛ, «Fa be, n xa Yɛxɛɛyɔrɛ xa ginɛ masen i bɛ, naxan xa futi fama xiride.» <verse eid="REV 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10" />A naxa n xaxili xanin geya xungbe itexi ma. Mɛnni a naxa na taa sɛniyɛnxi masen n bɛ, naxan findixi na Darisalamu ra, naxan nu bara goro kelife koore ma Ala sɛɛti ma. <verse eid="REV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11" />Ala xa nɔrɛ nu na a ma, a nu yanbama alɔ gɛmɛ tofanyi naxan maniyaxi diyaman na. <verse eid="REV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12" />A xa tɛtɛ nu ite, naadɛ fu nu firin nu na a ma, malekɛ fu nun firin nu tixi na naadɛe ra e makantafe ma. Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ fu nun firin xili nu sɛbɛxi na naadɛe ma. <verse eid="REV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13" />Naadɛ saxan nu na sogetede mabiri, naadɛ saxan nu na kɔɔla mabiri, naadɛ saxan nu na yirefanyi mabiri, naadɛ saxan nu na sogegorode mabiri. <verse eid="REV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14" />Taa tɛtɛ nu tixi na gɛmɛ safɛ fu nun firin nan fari, Yɛxɛɛyɔrɛ xa xɛɛra fu nun firin xilie nu sɛbɛxi e ma. <verse eid="REV 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15" />Maniyase xɛɛma daaxi nu na na malekɛ yi ra, naxan nu wɔyɛnma n bɛ, alako a xa nɔ taa, a naadɛe, nun a tɛtɛ maniyade. <verse eid="REV 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16" />Taa kuyɛ, taa igboɲa, nun taa iteya, a birin nu lanxi kilo wulu firin, kilo kɛmɛ firin, kilo mɔxɔɲɛn nan ma. <verse eid="REV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17" />Malekɛ naxa tɛtɛ fan maniya adama ki ma. Na naxa lan kanke ya tongo saxan nun senni ma.<verse eid="REV 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18" />Tɛtɛ nu yailanxi gɛmɛ tofanyi nan na naxan maniya diyaman na. Taa tan nu yailanxi xɛɛma xɔri fanyi nan na naxan tinse alɔ ye. <verse eid="REV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19" />Taa tɛtɛ nu tixi gɛmɛ xungbee nan fari. Gɛmɛ tofanyi mɔɔli birin nan nu na gɛmɛ xungbee raxunmaxi. Gɛmɛ xungbe singe raxunmaxi gɛmɛ tofanyi nde nan na naxan xili falama yasipe, a firin nde raxunmaxi gɛmɛ tofanyi nde nan na naxan xili falama safiri, a saxan nde kalisedone, a naani nde emerode, <verse eid="REV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20" />a suuli nde sarodonixi, a senni nde sarodone, a solofere nde kirosolite, a solomasaxan nde berili, a solomanaani nde topasi, a fu nde kirisopirase, a fu nun keren nde hiyasinti, a fu nun firin nde ametisite. <verse eid="REV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21" />Tɛtɛ naadɛ fu nun firin nu yailanxi gɛmɛ tofanyie nan na naxee na baa ma. Naadɛ birin findixi gɛmɛ keren nan na. Taa malande nu yailanxi xɛɛma xɔri fanyi nan na naxan tinse alɔ ye.<verse eid="REV 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22" />N mu Ala xa hɔrɔmɔlingira toxi taa kui, barima Marigi Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanyi nun Yɛxɛɛyɔrɛ nan na hɔrɔmɔbanxi ra. <verse eid="REV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23" />Na taa hayi mu nu na soge ma, xa na mu a ra kike ma, alako a xa naiyalanyi sɔtɔ. Ala xa nɔrɛ nan findima a xa naiyalanyi ra, Yɛxɛɛyɔrɛ findima a xa lanpui nan na. <verse eid="REV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24" />Sie ɲɛrɛma a xa naiyalanyi nan kui, duniɲa mangɛe fama nɛ a binyade. <verse eid="REV 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25" />Na taa naadɛe mu balanma, barima kɔɛ mu soma naa. <verse eid="REV 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26" />Sie fama nɛ Ala binyade naa, e a matɔxɔ. <verse eid="REV 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27" />Se sɛniyɛntare yo mu soma naa, mixi naxan fe xɔnxi rabama nun mixi naxan wule falama, e fan mu soma naa. Mixi naxee xili sɛbɛxi Yɛxɛɛyɔrɛ xa kisi buki kui, e gbansan nan soma na.<verse eid="REV 21:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22" />
  <para style="s">Ala xa kisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1" />Na malekɛ naxa kisi xure masen n bɛ. A nu tinse alɔ diyaman, a nu minima Ala nun Yɛxɛɛyɔrɛ xa kibanyi nan kui, <verse eid="REV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2" />a fa findi xure ra taa tagi. Kisi sansie nu tixi a dɛ firin na, e nu bogi kike yo kike, sanmaya fu nun firin ɲɛ kui. E burɛxɛ findixi seri nan na ɲamanɛe bɛ. <verse eid="REV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3" />Dankɛ yo mu na sɔnɔn. Ala nun Yɛxɛɛyɔrɛ xa kibanyi na taa kui. Ala xa konyie a xui rabatuma, <verse eid="REV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4" />e a yatagi to, a xili sɛbɛxi e tigi ma. <verse eid="REV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5" />Kɔɛ mu soma naa, e hayi mu na lanpui nun soge naiyalanyi ma sɔnɔn, barima Marigi Ala nan findixi e xa naiyalanyi ra. Ala xa konyie yaamari tima nɛ naa abadan.<verse eid="REV 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6" />Malekɛ naxa a fala n bɛ, «Yi masenyi nɔndi nan a ra, a mu kanama. Marigi Ala, naxan namiɲɔnmɛ xaxili raɲɛrɛma, a naxa a xa malekɛ xɛɛ alako a xa a masen a xa konyie bɛ naxan fama rabade waxati makɔrɛxi ra.»<verse eid="REV 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7" />Isa naxa a masen, «I xa a kolon, a gbe mu luxi n xa fa. Ɲɛlɛxinyi na mixi bɛ naxan yi masenyi rabatuma, naxan sɛbɛxi yi Kitaabui kui Ala xili ra.»<verse eid="REV 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8" />N tan Yaya, n bara na fe birin mɛ, n bara na fe birin to. N to na mɛ, n to na to, n naxa bira na malekɛ bun ma naxan nu bara na fee masen n bɛ, alako n xa a batu. <verse eid="REV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9" />Kɔnɔ a naxa a fala n bɛ, «Ade, i naxa na raba. N fan findixi Ala xa konyi nan na alɔ i tan nun i ngaxakerenyi naxee findixi namiɲɔnmɛe ra, a nun mixi naxee yi Kitaabui xa masenyi rabatuma. I xa Ala batu.»<verse eid="REV 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10" />Na dangi xanbi na malekɛ naxa a fala n bɛ, «I naxa yi masenyi balan tɔnxuma ra sinden, naxan sɛbɛxi yi Kitaabui kui Ala xili ra, barima waxati bara makɔrɛ. <verse eid="REV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11" />Tinxintare xa lu tinxintareya kui, sɛniyɛntare xa lu sɛniyɛntareɲa kui, tinxintɔɛ xa lu tinxinyi kui, sɛniyɛntɔɛ xa lu sɛniyɛnyi kui.»<verse eid="REV 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12" />Isa naxa a masen, «I xa a kolon, a gbe mu luxi n xa fa, n man fama nɛ mixi birin xa kɛwali sare ra. <verse eid="REV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13" />N tan nan findixi fe singe nun fe dɔnxɔɛ ra, a fɔlɛ nun a raɲɔnyi ra. <verse eid="REV 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14" />Ɲɛlɛxinyi na mixi bɛ naxee e yɛtɛ sɛniyɛnma, alako e xa kisi sansi bogi don, e man xa nɔ sode na taa kui naadɛ ra. <verse eid="REV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15" />Fe ɲaaxi rabae na taa fari ma, mandurulae, yɛnɛlae, faxɛtie, kuye batuie, nun wule falɛ birin wule rafan naxee ma. <verse eid="REV 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16" />N tan Isa, n bara n ma malekɛ xɛɛ seedeɲɔxɔya ra danxaniyatɔɛ ɲamae ma. N tan findixi Dawuda bɔnsɔɛ sanke nan na, n tan findixi Dawuda bɔnsɔɛ nan na. N luma nɛ alɔ subaxɛ looloe.»<verse eid="REV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17" />Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi nun ginɛ naxan xa futi xirima, e birin a falama, «Fa.» Naxan na a mɛ, na fan xa a fala, «Fa! Ye xɔli na naxan ma, a xa fa. Naxan wama a minfe, a xa kisi ye tongo, a xa a min, a mu sarama!»<verse eid="REV 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18" />N tan Yaya bara findi seede ra mixi birin bɛ naxee bara yi masenyi mɛ naxan sɛbɛxi yi Kitaabui kui Ala xili ra. Xa a sa li mixi nde fama fe gbɛtɛ nde sade yi masenyi fari, Ala nan fama tɔɔrɛ sade na kanyi ma, alɔ tɔɔrɛ naxan ma fe sɛbɛxi yi Kitaabui kui. <verse eid="REV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19" />Xa a sa li mixi nde naxa wɔyɛnyi nde ba yi namiɲɔnmɛ xa masenyi ra naxan sɛbɛxi yi Kitaabui kui, Ala nan fama kisi sansi kɛ bade a yi ra, a fa lu taa sɛniyɛnxi fari ma, alɔ a sɛbɛxi yi Kitaabui kui ki naxɛ. <verse eid="REV 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20" />Yi seede naxan seedeɲɔxɔya baxi, a xa masenyi nan ya, a naxɛ, «Iyo, a gbe mu luxi n xa fa.» Amina. Marigi Isa, i xa fa!<verse eid="REV 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21" />Marigi Isa xa hinnɛ birin na.<verse eid="REV 22:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22" />
</usx>